          }
        }
      }
    },
    "(SetProcessDEPPolicy, permanent) therefore switched DEP back on for a running 32-bit game that had turned it off, and virtual_set_force_exec's sweep re-protected every view of every pseudo-process from the browser's thread: every executa...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
