    ".data GLOBAL, not an IAT — the IAT-restricted pass finds nothing and the same VA keeps costing one Mach exception per Metal call (118K+ observed; handler saturation = the desktop \"freezes\"). When the IAT pass strikes out, scan each copy'...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ".data Global，而不是一个IAT——IAT限制的通行证找不到任何东西，同一个VA每一次金属调用(118K+观察;处理器饱和度=桌面\"冻结\")都会花费一个Mach例外. IAT通过时，扫描每个拷贝'..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0 (default): no limit. N: a reservation larger than N MB is backed by the swap file only, never by the donor pool (a test; a game's own big heap is usually hot and runs faster in donor RAM). Read at session start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0( 默认 ):无限制。 N: 保留大于 N MB 的仅由互换文件支持，绝不由共享内存池支持( 测试; 游戏本身的大堆积通常很热，在捐赠者RAM 中运行得更快 )。在会话开始时读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0 (default): off. N: Social Club's SocialClubHelper.exe and Steam's steamwebhelper.exe see at most N MB of available physical memory, nobody else (the game and the launcher keep the real figure). Below 400 (e.g. 300) Chromium reports critical memory pressure every 5 s and purges caches and garbage; 400-999 (e.g. 900), moderate every 10 s. Independent of avail-phys. Set it in the game's own file; read at session start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0（默认）表示关闭。设为 N 后，只有 SocialClubHelper.exe 和 steamwebhelper.exe 会看到最多 N MB 的可用物理内存。低于 400 时，Chromium 每 5 秒触发严重内存压力处理并清理缓存。设为 400–999 时，每 10 秒触发中等内存压力处理。此项独立于 avail-phys，在会话开始时从游戏自己的配置读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0 fails the load of an image whose shared writable section is not aligned to the host page, as before; otherwise that section is mapped private.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0 无法像以前一样将共享可写部分与主机页面对齐的图像负载;否则该部分是私有的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0 keeps the executable window from a fixed-base (relocations stripped) image smaller than 64 MB, as before; such a program then fails to start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0 将可执行窗口从一个小于64 MB的固定基数( 已剥离) 图像中保留下来，和以前一样;这样的程序随后无法启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0 leaves the profile's AppData\\LocalLow folder missing, as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0 显示配置文件的 AppData\\ LocalLow 文件夹丢失，和以前一样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0 limits the media parser to MP3/WAV; by default MP4 with H.264/HEVC video decodes through VideoToolbox.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0限制媒体解析器为MP3/WAV;默认为MP4，其H.264/HEVC视频通过VideoToollbox解码."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0 restores the old fixed-base handoff: claims are matched without rounding the image size to host pages, and a new main image never waits for the previous owner of the executable window to exit.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0恢复旧的固定基数交接:在不将图像大小四舍五入到主机页面的情况下进行债权匹配，新的主图像从不等待执行窗口的上一个所有者退出."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0 treats JIT as ready whenever CS_DEBUGGED is set, as before, without asking whether a debugger is attached.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0 将 JIT 处理为 CS_ DEBUGGED 设置时的准备，如前，不询问是否附加调试器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0 walks the whole map on every failed large mapping; by default a failed walk is trusted for 2 s until a release.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0在每次失败的大绘图上行走整个地图;默认情况下，一个失败的行走会被信任为2 s直到发布."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0.1% lows": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0.1% 低帧率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
