            "value": "0:一个32位位的客户机窗口保留了4 GB加上上面的守护页，和以前一样(默认 1: 守护者是窗口的顶页，因此上面的4 GB 间隙保持4 GB-access) ."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0: a 32-bit helper in the game's folder keeps the 64-bit title's memory on the swap file first": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
