            "value": "0: 游戏文件夹中一个32位的帮助器首先将64位标题的内存保存在互换文件中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0: a Dock start's starting screen ends on the desktop's first frame, as before": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0: 桌面第一个框架的开始屏幕结束，如以前一样"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0: a FEX code buffer released while a thread runs in it is refused and stays live, as before": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
