      }
    },
    "0: a child's environment stays as its creator built it": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0: 儿童的环境与创造者所创造的环境相同"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0: a code buffer request takes the smallest free buffer that fits, however much larger, as before": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0: 代码缓冲请求需要最小的自由缓冲，无论大小如何，如以前一样"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0: a full-screen window shown with activation is left to the foreground lock": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0: 启动时显示的全屏窗口留到前景锁定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0: a hinted reservation at a 4 GB boundary (V8's trusted range) takes a kernel pick as before, and furniture may fill the 4 GB-aligned gigabyte above a guest window (default 1: 4 GB-aligned bases are tried first and that gigabyte is left...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0:在4GB边界(V8的可信任范围)上提示的预留会像以前一样采取内核选择，家具可能填补客户机窗口上方的4GB对齐的千兆字节(默认1:先尝试4GB对齐的基数，而千兆字节左侧. )."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0: a one-time installer's dialog never reveals the desktop by itself": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0: 一次性安装器对话框从不单独显示桌面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0: a session of one-time installs keeps the game's layout lines": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0: 一次性安装的会话会保留游戏的布局线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0: a session that starts the service manager keeps madsync": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0: 启动服务管理器保持疯狂同步的会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0: a tap or click on an active window leaves its keyboard focus as it is": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
