    "A thread of a child process in its own guest window gets THAT process's PEB32 (the page after its PEB), not the main process's wow_peb, when its argument is the PEB. MADEIRA_WOW_CHILD_PEB=0 always passes wow_peb as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
