    "Also drives MADEIRA_SURF_SEQ: bursts of N CONSECUTIVE frames, so the black regions that change every frame can be measured frame-to-frame offline. The 2s-throttled first/latest dump structurally cannot show that. Dirty rect goes in the f...": {
