    "Appended verbatim to SocialClubHelper.exe's command line while env.MADEIRA_SC_CEF is on, e.g. --disable-gpu or --enable-logging=file --v=1. A --js-flags= in it gets --jitless as its first flag (Chromium keeps only the last --js-flags=), unless MADEIRA_JITLESS = 0.": {
