        }
      }
    },
    "Donor pool": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共享内存池"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Donor pool free-RAM margin (MB)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共享内存池保留的空闲内存（MB）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Donor pool gives the swap tier RAM that does not count against Madeira's memory limit: memory donated by Madeira's helper extension, which creates it, hands it over and exits, used before the swap file while the phone has memory to spare. It stops taking more when iOS reports memory pressure. Experimental; needs the swap tier on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共享内存池为交换层提供额外内存，不计入 Madeira 的内存上限。Madeira 的辅助扩展申请并交接这块内存后退出。有空余内存时会优先使用它，再使用交换文件。iOS 报告内存压力时将停止申请。此功能尚在试验中，需启用交换层。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Donor pool memory kind": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共享内存池的内存类型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Donor pool size": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
