            "value": "生态排程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Empty by default: every thread stack is at least 8 MB (Chromium needs that). Exe names, separated by commas (e.g. RDR2.exe): threads of these programs get the stack they ask for, at least 2 MB, so their stacks take less of the shared memory space. Never list Chromium programs (SocialClubHelper.exe, Launcher.exe, steamwebhelper.exe). Read when a thread starts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认留空，每个线程堆栈至少分配 8 MB，满足 Chromium 的需求。此处可填写用逗号分隔的 EXE 名称（例如 RDR2.exe），使相应程序的线程按需分配，最少 2 MB。请避开 SocialClubHelper.exe、Launcher.exe 和 steamwebhelper.exe 等 Chromium 程序。线程启动时读取此项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Empty fragment function for pipelines without a pixel shader": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有像素遮蔽器的管道的空片段功能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Empty: Wine takes the user locale from the device's language. en_US.UTF-8 gives the game an English system and user locale, for a game that fails right after loading a non-English OEM code page. Read at session start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空 : Wine从设备的语言中取用用户语言. en_US.UTF-8 给游戏一个英语系统和用户语言，对于一个在加载非英语的 OEM 代码页后失败的游戏。 会在会话开始时读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
