    "Expands virtual address space to ~64GB. Required for large games. Must be injected via GetMoreRam (free accounts can't provision this).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将虚拟地址空间扩大到约 64 GB。大型游戏需要此权限。免费账号无法配置此权限，需通过 GetMoreRam 添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Experiment, default 0. 10 or 11 reports DXR tier 1.0 or 1.1 in OPTIONS5 although the runtime has no ray tracing (its calls stay unimplemented stubs, logged once). Only for finding out whether a game's device check wants it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实验，默认为 0. 10 或 11 报告 OPSIONS5 中的 DXR 级 1. 0 或 1. 1 级，尽管运行时没有射线跟踪(它的呼叫会保留未执行的根，一次登录)。 仅用于查找游戏设备检查是否想要它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Experiment, default off. 1: the stages of a DXIL tessellation pipeline are converted with the converter's patch input topology instead of triangles; such shaders are cached apart.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实验，默认关闭. 1: DXIL 切换管的阶段与转换器的补丁输入地形转换，而不是三角形;这种遮蔽器被缓存."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Experiment: DXIL tessellation with the patch input topology": {
