          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Explains why JIT cannot be enabled on a copy signed without get-task-allow; 0 opens StikDebug regardless. A debugger can attach only to a process whose signature carries get-task-allow (a development signature). A copy signed with a dist...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解释为什么JIT无法在未获得任务- 允许的情况下在签名的副本上启用; 0 打开 StikDebug不管怎样。 调试器只能附加到其签名带有获得任务- 允许( 开发签名) 的进程上。 带有 dist 签名的副本..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exported as DXMT_CONFIG with the options joined by ';', a library game's own dxmt options after these: e.g. d3d11.mipClampBC=1;d3d11.preferredMaxFrameRate=30. DXMT reads at most 259 characters of it, and nothing at all from a longer value (ml1255).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导出为 DXMT_ CONFIG，选项为 ';'，之后是库游戏自己的 dxmt 选项:例如 d3d11.mipClampBC=1; d3d11. previous MaxFrameRate=30. DXMT 最多读取 259 个字符，更长的值(ml1255) 完全没有."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Extended Virtual Addressing": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩展虚拟地址空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
