    "Extra code page tables": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "额外的代码页面表格"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FEX's Mono backpatcher bridge (ml712). On by itself for Wine Mono, 32- and 64-bit (ml1282/ml1286); for the 32-bit runtime in a guest window it also turns SMC detection off once the backpatcher is found (ml1280). 0 keeps it off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FEX的Mono回扣桥(ml712)，单为WineMono,32-和64-bit(ml1282/ml1286);对于客机窗口的32-bit运行时，一旦找到回扣桥(ml1280)，它也会关闭SMC检测."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FEX: record images loaded before it starts": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FEX: 开始前记录已装入的图像"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FEX: x86 ordering for the whole image": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FEX: x86 命令整个图像"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fastsync (in-process sync, default)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fastsync(在进程同步，默认)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fastsync is the default engine: with neither this nor inproc-sync set, the app exports auto. Settings > Sync engine > Fastsync removes both keys. Never runs while madsync is on. auto arms the fast wake path on heavy event traffic, 1 from the start, cells only answers polls, 0 is off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fastsync是默认的引擎: 既无此功能，也无inproc- sync 设置，应用程序导出自动。 设置> Sync 引擎> Fastsync删除两个密钥。在疯狂sync 打开时，绝不运行。 自动武装重事件流量的快速警醒路径, 1从开始，单元格只回答民调, 0 关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fault guards tell FEX's invalid instructions apart": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "错误的守护者将 FEX 无效的指令分开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fault-storm guards end only a real storm": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
