          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全屏将游戏窗口移动到整个屏幕上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fullscreen rect: the window's monitor origin plus the backbuffer extent. ml1140: on iOS the old borderless-only path left a large fullscreen window on a smaller virtual desktop, so pointer clamping stopped short. This is a virtual win32u...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全屏矩形: 窗口的显示器来源加上后缓冲范围.ml1140:在iOS上，旧的无边形仅限路径在更小的虚拟桌面上留下了一个大全屏窗口，因此指针夹住短短停止了。这是虚拟的win32u..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GB at the top of the FEX arena kept for a 32-bit program's emulator while MADEIRA_WOW_HOLD_WINDOWS is set (default 3); 0: none": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GB在 FEX 竞技场的顶端保留一个32 位程序模拟器，而 MADEIRA_WOW_HOLD_WINDOWS 设置( 默认 3); 0:无"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GOG Galaxy's game services (sign-in, achievements, stats, leaderboards) for GOG games, answered by Madeira on 127.0.0.1:9977 while one runs (docs/GOG.md, \"Galaxy\"); 0 turns them off, in madeira.cfg or in one game's own config": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GOG Galaxy为GOG游戏提供的游戏服务(签名，成就，统计，领导板)，由Madeira在127.0.0.1:9977回答，一运行时(docs/GOG.md,\"Galaxy\");0关闭，以makeira.cfg或一游戏自己的配置."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Game language: the language Steam downloads install, and the one Steam tells the game to use. A game without it gets English. Installed games keep their language until you choose Download in their page.\n\nDownloads from PCs on this network: a game's download comes first from a PC on the same network whose Steam has it installed and up to date, through Steam's local network game transfers (Steam on the PC: same account, Settings › Downloads › Game file transfer over local network on, no download or game running). Anything the PC does not have comes from Steam's servers. Madeira finds the PC through Steam and shows up in the account's devices as \"Madeira\". PC address: only when the PC is not found; its IP address on this network.\n\nMadeira keeps a Steam sign-in token in this device's Keychain, for this device only. Signing out removes it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏语言：决定 Steam 下载的语言内容，以及启动时传给游戏的语言。游戏不支持该语言时会使用英语。已安装的游戏会保留当前语言，直至在游戏详情页选择「下载该语言内容」。\n\n从此网络上的电脑下载：Madeira 会通过 Steam 的局域网游戏传输功能，优先从同一网络中已安装并更新该游戏的电脑下载。电脑上需登录相同账号，在「设置 › 下载」中开启局域网游戏文件传输，且没有正在运行的游戏或下载。电脑缺少的内容仍从 Steam 服务器获取。Madeira 会通过 Steam 查找电脑，并在账号设备列表中显示为「Madeira」。仅当找不到电脑时，才需填写该电脑在此网络上的 IP 地址。\n\nMadeira 会在此设备的钥匙串存放仅供本机使用的 Steam 登录令牌。退出登录会移除该令牌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Game sound in the background": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "背景中的游戏声音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
