    },
    "Graphics card the game sees": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "向游戏报告的显卡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grid": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网格"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Guest windows are reserved lazily; this reserves nothing unless a 32-bit main image was published or MADEIRA_WOW_PLACEHOLDERS=1 (see ios_wow_session_start). Last, after the holdback, whose first page the lowest slot borrows as its guard.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "客机窗口保留懒惰;除非发布32 位主图像或 MADEIRA_WOW_ PLACEHOLDERS=1 (参见 ios_ wow_session_start)，否则不会保留任何东西。最后，拖住之后，拖住的第一页中，借到的最低槽作为它的守护。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HID mode: keep player 1 on XInput too": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HID 模式: 将玩家 1 也保留在XInput 上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HID mode: other pads as a generic HID gamepad": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HID 模式: 其它垫作为通用的 HID 游戏板"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HID, always a DualSense": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HID，总是双关语"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HID, always a generic gamepad": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HID，总是通用的游戏板"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Healing default-ON since 2026-07-07: the patcher now rewrites ONLY IAT/delay-IAT slots (parsed from each pool copy's PE headers), so the 2026-07-04 breakage class — arm64x metadata slots whose consumers need PE VAs for identity/range com...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自2026-07-07起修复默认-ON:补丁机现在只重写IAT/延时-IAT插槽(从每份泳池副本的PE头中分出)，所以2026-07-04断裂类——arm64x元数据插槽，消费者需要PE VAs来进行身份/距离共线. ."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Heuristic: x86_64 guest exes (cube-x64, hello-x64, real games like Thumper) need the arm64ec-windows bundle (ARM64EC hybrid system DLLs that interop with FEX-translated x86_64 code). ARM64-native tests (cube.exe) use the aarch64-windows ...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "heuristic: x86_64 嘉宾前(cube-x64,hello-x64，真游戏如Thumper)需要arm64ec-windows捆绑(ARM64EC混合系统DLLs，与FEX-Ormped x86_64代码交叉). ARM64-native测试(cube.exe)使用arch64-windows......"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hidden achievement": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏成就"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold CPU power with a frame cap (mW)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "持有带帧盖的 CPU 功率 (mW)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold GPU work in the background": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在背景中保留 GPU 工作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Host-only: lets the offline round-trip test point at the converter in the extracted package. Compiled out of the device build entirely, so the shipping runtime has exactly one place it will load the converter from.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只主机:让提取包中转换器的离线圆路测试点。 编译出设备后完全构建，因此运算运行时只有一个位置可以装入转换器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long a released 1-16 MB guest allocation stays mapped before it is really freed (default 0: freed at once; 2000 ms is the tested hold).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "释放的 1-16 MB 客户机分配在真正释放前会保持多久( 默认 0: 一次释放; 2000 ms是测试的控件)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long a remembered listing is used without checking the directory, while no file was created, renamed, linked or deleted through Wine. After that one stat of the directory decides whether it is read again. 0 checks it on every lookup. Read once per app run.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在不检查目录的情况下使用记忆中的列表有多长时间，而没有通过 Wine 创建、 重新命名、 链接或删除文件。在此之后，一个目录的 STAT决定它是否被再次读取。 0 检查它是否在每次搜索中。 在每个应用程序运行时读一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much sound Madeira keeps queued ahead of the speaker (10-500 ms, default 60). If a game's sound crackles or sounds scratchy, a larger buffer usually clears it, at the cost of sound lagging slightly behind the picture: Black Ops II's Zombies crackled at 60 ms and was clean at 150. A game's own config can set it for that game alone. Applies at the next game start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira在扬声器前排队多少(10-500ms，默认为60ms)，如果游戏的声音裂缝或声音抓痒，通常一个更大的缓冲器会清除它，代价是声音略落后于画面:黑Ops II的僵尸裂缝60ms,150ms，被清理干净. 游戏自己的配置可以单独设定为游戏，在下一个游戏开始时应用."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'll do this later": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "稍后再做"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IO_STATUS_BLOCK32 one guest window iOS maps nothing below 4 GB": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
