    "Load OSMesa and prove Zink actually runs: a throwaway core-profile context must report the Zink renderer. Mesa quietly falls back to softpipe when Zink cannot start (no MoltenVK, missing Vulkan features), and a software rasterizer is not...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "装入OSMEsa并证明Zink实际运行:一个丢弃的核心外观上下文必须报告Zink渲染器. Mesa在Zink无法启动时悄悄地回到软管(没有MoltenVK，缺少Vulkan特性)，软件的光滑剂不是."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load either $DXMT_CONFIG_FILE or $PWD/dxmt.conf": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "装入$DXMT_CONFIG_FILE或$PWD/dxmt.conf"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load these DLLs with the D3D12 device": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 D3D12 设备装入这些 DLL"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loading Steam…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在加载 Steam…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local notifications when a Steam download finishes, fails or pauses while Madeira is in the background (permission asked at the first download). 0: none, and no permission request.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当一个Steam下载完成，失败或暂停时, Madeira 处于背景状态时( 第一次下载时请求许可)，本地通知。 0:无，且没有权限请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Log GPU and device power every 5 s": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日志 GPU 和设备功率每 5 s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Log code patches the emulated copy misses": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日志代码补丁仿真复制缺失"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Log the 64 GB address band by piece": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐块记录 64 GB 地址带"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Log where Direct3D 12 submission time goes": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录 Direct3D 12 提交时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Logging for Steam sign-in. `event` lines are the always-on, low-volume record ([steam-signin]). They never contain tokens, passwords, Steam Guard codes, account names, Steam IDs or message payloads. `trace` lines are protocol-level detai...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 登录日志。`event` 行是始终启用的低量日志（[steam-signin]）。它们不会记录令牌、密码、Steam 令牌验证码、账号名称、Steam ID 或消息内容。`trace` 行记录协议级详情…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looking over the game's files…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看游戏的文档..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA (ml1190): DXMT_CLEAR_DISCARD_STORE is a Madeira switch (util_madeira_switch.hpp), on by default only in the i386 build.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA(ml1190):DXMT_CLEAR_DISCARD_STORE是一个Madeira开关(util_madeira_switch.hpp)，默认只在i386架构中使用."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA (ml1190): opt-in diagnostics, DXMT_DISPLAY_MODE_STATS=1.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA(ml1190):选入诊断,DXMT_DISPLAY_MODE_STATS=1."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA (ml1490): with DXMT_ZERO_BUFFER_POW2, grow to the next power of two (at least 1 MB) instead of the exact request. Each growth costs a flushInternal(), and a loading screen asking for slowly rising sizes regrew the buffer 322 time...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA(ml1490):随着DXMT_ZERO_BUFFER_POW2，增长到2个(至少1 MB)的下一个功率，而不是精确的要求。每次增长都花费一个冲浪内核( )，而一个装入屏幕要求缓冲器322时间缓慢上升..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA: CodeInvalidationMutex is not recursive. When this thread already write-owns it, a second exclusive lock parks the thread behind itself, and every other thread queues behind it for good (log 56: one thread waiting on the lock it ...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA: Code Invalidation Mutex不是递归性的。当此线程已经拥有它时，第二个独家锁会将线程停放在后面，以及后面的每一个线程队列都会永远地等待它(log 56: 一条线程在锁上等待它...)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA: StrictInProcessSplitLocks defaults ON for 32-bit guests. * An x86 LOCK op on a word that crosses a 16-byte boundary faults on this host and FEX emulates it as two separate half-width CASes. Without the strict mode two threads do...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA: 严格InProcessSplitLocks默认为 32 位嘉宾的 ON。*对于一个字，一个 x86 LOCK 操作，它跨越了这个主机上一个16字节的边界断层, FEX作为两个独立的半宽 CAS 来模拟它。没有严格的模式, 2 线程是..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA: hot SMC pages (InvalidationTracker::EnableHotSMCPages). MADEIRA_SMC_HOT_PAGE: unset = 64 write faults within a second, 0 = off (every write to a code page invalidates it), N = threshold.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA:热SMC页面(认证跟踪器:EnableHotSMCPages). MADEIRA_SMC_HOT_PAGE:未设置=64个秒内写断层,0=关闭(每写到一个代码页，其无效),N=阈值."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA: rate-limit the call-ret reset that follows a code invalidation. * On the iOS host nothing reads the stack's contents: the RET shortcut (BranchOps.cpp, ml305) and the EnterEC return (Dispatcher.cpp) are compiled out, so a skipped...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA: 速率限制在代码无效后重新设置调用。*在 iOS主机上，没有读到堆栈的内容 : RET快捷键( BranchOps.cpp,ml305) 和 EnterEC 返回(Dispatcher.cpp) 被编译出来，所以一个跳过..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA: the 64-bit (ARM64EC) build is the x64 programs' d3d9.dll, in place of Wine's, which needs OpenGL and so always failed to create here. MADEIRA_D3D9_X64=0 makes creation fail the same way again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA:64位(ARM64EC)的构建是x64程序'd3d9.dll，取代Wine's，它需要OpenGL，所以总是在这里失败创建. MADEIRA_D3D9 ⁇ 64=0使创建再次以同样的方式失败."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA: winegstreamer's unix side is bound for 32-bit (wow64) callers, and for 64-bit (ARM64EC) ones too: without it an x64 program's xWMA voices (FAudio's WMA decoder DMO, wmadmod -> winegstreamer) decode to silence. A 64-bit caller ge...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA:酒液流器的unix侧面为32位(wow64)调用器,64位(ARM64EC)调用器也绑定:没有它，一个x64程序XWMA的声音(FAudio的WMA解码器DMO,wmadmod -> 酒液流器)解码为静态. A 64位调用器 GE..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_CPU_COUNT, a per-launch setting the app exports for one program, wins over the global key; unset = the key's behaviour.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_CPU_COUNT，每发射一次设置一个程序的应用导出，胜过全局密钥;未设置=密钥的行为."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_CTX_FP=0: a cross-thread GetThreadContext returns zeroed vector registers, as before. madeira.cfg (and the game's own lines) are read first: this server starts before the app exports env.* lines (ml1236) and runs again for the ne...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_CTQQFP=0:一个跨线的 GetThreadContext 返回零向量登记，和以前一样.madeira.cfg(和游戏本身的行)首先读到:此服务器在app导出env.*行(ml1236)前开始，并再次运行为 ne..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_DEFER_SECTION_ABORT=0: a killed thread exits at once, even inside a section": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_DEFER_SECTION_ABORT=0:一个被杀死的线程立即退出，甚至在一节内"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_DIAG=1 lifts the cap; read once. Local to this file so the media unix side links against nothing but upstream's libntdll_unix.a.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_DIAG=1 抬起盖子; 读一次。 本地到此文件后，媒体会解锁侧链接，只针对上游的 libndll_ unix. a。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_DIRECT_CURSOR=0: no cursor is drawn on the game view, motion stays relative there and the pointer never locks by itself; the driver reports nothing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_DIREECT_CURSOR=0:游戏视图上没有绘制光标，运动保持相对，指针本身从不锁定;驱动程序不报告任何情况."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_DIRECT_WINDOW_SIZE=1: keep an opted-in presenting window's client at the selected resolution, including an engine resize after startup. Default off; desktop sessions and ordinary windowed games are unchanged.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_DIRECT_WINDOW_SIZE=1: 保留选中的窗口客户端在选中的解析度，包括启动后更改引擎大小。 默认关闭; 桌面会话和普通的Windows 游戏不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_EXT_PROBE=1: at session start the JIT helper extension reports the address space and memory limit its own process gets (ml1310 feasibility probe for extension processes)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_EXT_PROBE=1: 开始会话时 JIT 帮助扩展报告地址空间和内存限制它自己的进程获得(扩展进程的可行性探测器ml1310)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_FEX_FAIL_CALLRET=threadstate:N fails the Nth thread-state allocation, so this containment path can be proven rather than assumed -- it only occurs naturally once the band is exhausted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_FEQQFAIL_CALLRET=threadstate:N 失败了Nth线程状态分配，因此这个封存路径可以被证明而不是假设——它只有在乐队用尽后自然发生."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_FREE_DELAY_REUSE=0: a reservation over held releases fails until the delay runs out, as before; default 1: those held ranges are freed at once": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_FREE_DEAY_REUSE=0: 与以前一样，对被扣留的释放的保留失败，直到延迟结束; 默认 1: 被扣押的释放范围立即释放"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_FRONTEND_KEYBOARD=0: the game view's own keyboard instead.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_FRONTEND_KEYBOARD=0:游戏景点自有键盘代替."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_HWINPUT=0: no keyboard/mouse bridging, no pointer recognisers, no touch filter, no drawn cursor; the app behaves as it did before this file existed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_HWINPUT=0:没有键盘/mouse连接，没有指针识别器，没有触摸过滤器，没有绘制光标;应用在文件存在之前就表现了它的行为."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_IMAGE_RELOAD (default 1): 1 the same image reloaded at the same base by the same process gets its copy rebuilt in place (same pool address, fresh bytes, relocations and x18 patches redone); any other reuse of an unmapped copy get...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_IMAGE_RELOAD(默认 1): 1 同一进程在同一基点重新装入的相同图像，其副本被重建到位(相同的池地址，新鲜字节，迁移和x18补丁重排); 任何未刷新副本的其他再使用获得."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_INPUT_FOCUS=0: keyboard and mouse reach the program whatever has focus (the program still gets nothing while the app is inactive: held input is released then).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_INPUT_FOCUS=0:键盘和鼠标到达任何有焦点的程序(程序在应用程序不活动时仍然得不到任何效果:持有的输入随后被发布)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_LAZY_PLACEHOLDERS=0 reserves 64 MB to 1 GB placeholders whole again (ml1310)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_LAZY_PLACEHOLDERS=0 保留了64 MB到1GB的占位符，再次完整(ml1310)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_LIBRARY_COLLAPSE=0: the section titles do not collapse.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_LIBRAY_COLLAPSE=0:该部分标题不会崩溃."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_POINTER_ABSOLUTE=0: the program's cursor never follows the iOS pointer's position; all motion is relative.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_POINTER_ABSOLUTE=0:程序的光标从未遵循iOS指针的位置;所有运动都是相对的."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_POINTER_AUTOLOCK=0: the pointer locks only on request, not while the program hides its cursor (see `AutoLock`).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 MADEIRA_POINTER_AUTOLOCK=0 后，仅在请求时锁定指针。程序隐藏鼠标指针时不会自动锁定（参见 `AutoLock`）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_POINTER_HIDDEN_ABSOLUTE=1 (a game's own config): the program's cursor follows the iOS pointer's position even while it hides the Windows cursor, and the pointer never locks by itself. For a game that hides the cursor only to draw...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_POINTER_HIDDEN_ABSOLUTE=1(游戏本身的配置):程序光标在隐藏Windows光标的同时，也遵循iOS指针的位置，指针从不单独锁定。对于只隐藏光标的游戏来说，只能绘制..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_POINTER_LOCK=0: the pointer is never locked and no lock button or chord is offered.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_POINTER_LOCK=0:指针从未锁定，也没有提供锁键或和弦."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_REGFLUSH_SAVE=0: RegFlushKey does nothing again; the registry is saved periodically and at exit (ml1310)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_REGFLUSH_SAVE=0:RegFlushKey再次无所作为;注册定期保存，退出时保存(ml1310)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_SCREEN_W/H: the virtual monitor's session default size, exported by the app before Wine starts (1024x768 when unset); a program's ChangeDisplaySettings changes the current size from there. MADEIRA_SCREEN_SRC names where the defau...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_SCREEN_W/H:虚拟显示器的会话默认大小，在酒开始前由应用程序导出(未设定时为1024x768);一个程序的更改DisplaySettings会从那里更改当前大小. MADEIRA_SCREEN_SRC 名称中defau..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_SWAP_PUNCH_DEFER=0 keeps every swap file punch synchronous, under the virtual lock.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_SWAP_PUNCH_DEFER=0 保持每一次互换文件的冲动同步，在虚拟锁下."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_UNIX_EXIT_ROUTE=0: a fatal unix-side error calls plain (shimmed) exit() again (ml1310)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_UNIXIT_ROUTE=0:一个致命的unix-side错误呼叫平原(shimmed)出口()再次(ml1310)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MADEIRA_VIRTUAL_MODE_SET=0: accept a listed mode without programming it -- the monitor keeps the session default size, as before this change.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MADEIRA_VIRTUAL_MODE_SET=0:接受一个不编程的列表模式——显示器保持会话默认大小，如同此更改之前."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MB left before the app's memory limit below which churny sizes are tiered too (default 768, 0 = never)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MB在应用程序的内存限制之前离开了，低于此限制的粗体大小也是分层的( 默认 768, 0 = 永远)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MB: when the 32-bit band has less free address space than this, idle 32-bit window placeholders are handed back (default 256); 0: never": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MB:当32位的频段拥有比此更少的自由地址空间时，闲置的32位窗口占位符会被递回( 默认 256); 0: 永远"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Made for this game": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此配置适用于该游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Madeira Dock could not initialize the Steam session (code 30). Export the log to identify the failed check.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira Dock 无法初始化Steam会话(代码 30)。导出日志以识别失败的检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Madeira Dock could not read the one-use Steam sign-in transfer. Steam has not checked the login yet. Export the log before trying again.": {
