    "Many Windows games are built with Microsoft Visual C++ and need its 2015-2022 runtime. Madeira downloads Microsoft's own installers and takes the runtime out of them, for 64-bit and 32-bit games alike. Games find it at their next start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "许多使用 Microsoft Visual C++ 开发的 Windows 游戏需要 2015–2022 运行库。Madeira 会从微软的安装程序中提取 64 位和 32 位运行库，下次启动游戏时即可使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Many Windows games need Microsoft's Visual C++ 2015-2022 runtime. Madeira downloads Microsoft's installers (about %lld MB, version %@) and takes the runtime DLLs out of them on this device, as Microsoft shipped them, for 64-bit and 32-bit games. No Windows session runs and nothing restarts: the next game start uses them. Microsoft's licence terms for the redistributable apply to the files.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "许多 Windows 游戏需要 Microsoft Visual C++ 2015–2022 运行库。Madeira 会下载微软的安装程序（约 %1$lld MB，版本 %2$@），并在本机提取微软原版的 64 位和 32 位运行库 DLL。无需启动 Windows 会话或重启，下次启动游戏时即可使用。文件适用微软可再发行组件的许可条款。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
