    },
    "Off by default: memory of the Chromium browsers next to a game (Social Club's SocialClubHelper.exe, Steam's steamwebhelper.exe) is backed by the swap file, never by the donor pool. The pool is handed out by reserved size whether the pages are used or not, and Social Club's 4 GB allocator reservation used to take all of it before the game asked. 1: browsers take donor RAM like any program. Read at session start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。SocialClubHelper.exe 和 steamwebhelper.exe 的 Chromium 内存由交换文件支持。设为 1 后，这些进程也可占用共享内存池。该池按保留空间分配，Social Club 的 4 GB 保留可能挤占游戏可用的内存。会话启动时读取此项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default: no Settings section, no refresh or offer over the library and no sign-in taken from an installer. A refresh asks Apple's portal for a profile on the Apple ID that signs other apps too, so the installer that signed Madeira...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭 :没有设置区域，也没有更新或提议在库中添加，也没有从安装器中获取签名。 刷新器会询问苹果的门户网站，以在苹果ID上签名其它应用程序的配置文件，因此签名 Madeira 的安装器..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default: one file per converted shader in Documents/shadercache, as before. 1: the converter keeps its DXBC and DXIL cache entries in two append-only files (shadercache/pack/dxbc.mdpk, dxil.mdpk); loose entries of earlier runs move in as games use them. Off again, the packs are not read: what moved into them converts again. Bounds: DXIL as env.MADEIRA_D3D12_DXIL_CACHE_MB (512 MB), DXBC 2 GB; a full pack starts over. Read once per app start; the game's own file wins.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭 : 文档/ 阴影中每个转换过的阴影器中有一个文件，如以前一样 : 1: 转换器将其 DXBC 和 DXIL 缓存条目保存在两个仅附加文件( shadercache/ pack/ dxbc.mdpk, dxil.mdpk); 先前运行的松散条目随游戏使用而移动。 关闭后，不再读取 : 哪些已移动到它们中。 Bounds: DXIL作为 env. MADEIRA_ D3D12_ DXIL_ CACHE_MB (512 MB), DXBC 2 GB;一个完整的包开始。 每一个应用程序启动后读取，游戏自己的文件获胜。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default: while a game keeps running in the background its sound is muted, and other apps' audio plays normally. 1: you keep hearing the game. A game's own config can set it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭:当游戏在背景中运行时，声音会变哑，而其他应用程序的音频播放正常. 1:您继续听到游戏。 游戏的自定义可以设置它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off with `env.MADEIRA_EA = 0`.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 `env.MADEIRA_EA = 0` 可关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off with `env.MADEIRA_EPIC = 0`.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 `env.MADEIRA_EPIC = 0` 可关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off with `env.MADEIRA_GOG = 0`.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 `env.MADEIRA_GOG = 0` 可关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off with `env.MADEIRA_ITCH = 0`.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 `env.MADEIRA_ITCH = 0` 可关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off with `env.MADEIRA_STEAM_LIBRARY = 0`, or without Madeira Dock (a downloaded game starts through it).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 `env.MADEIRA_STEAM_LIBRARY = 0` 可关闭。没有 Madeira Dock 时也会关闭，因为已下载的游戏通过它启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off with `env.MADEIRA_STEAM_WORKSHOP = 0`: no Workshop page or area.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 `env.MADEIRA_STEAM_WORKSHOP = 0` 后隐藏创意工坊页面和分区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off, MoltenVK with d3d12 = vkd3d or d3d11 = dxvk": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭，以 d3d12 = vkd3d 或 d3d11 = dxvk 的 MoltenVK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offer ID": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "商品 ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline: Steam found this game's license in what it saved. Starting the game…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "离线: Steam在它保存的游戏中发现了此游戏的许可证. 开始游戏..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline: Steam signed in from its saved sign-in. Checking this game's license…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "离线: Steam 从其保存的登录中签名。 正在检查此游戏的许可证..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Older NVIDIA card (Direct3D 9)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "较旧的 NVIDIA 显卡（Direct3D 9）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On (default)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开( 默认)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On (default): DXMT's DXGI presents for a Direct3D 12 device on Vulkan (d3d12 = vkd3d) by wrapping vkd3d-proton's swapchain (IDXGIVkSwapChainFactory); windowed only, a fullscreen request keeps the window. 0: CreateSwapChain fails with \"Unsupported device type\" for those devices, as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在(默认)上:DXMT的DXGI在Vulkan(d3d12 = vkd3d)上为Direct3D 12设备呈现，方法是将vkd3d-质子的互换链(IDXGIVkSwapChainFactory);窗口仅窗口，全屏请求保留窗口. 0:CreateSwapChain 失败，这些设备的\"不支持的设备类型\"，和以前一样."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On (default): XInput rumble plays on the controller (CoreHaptics), and in DualSense HID mode the game's output reports drive rumble, adaptive triggers (closest GameController mode), lightbar and player LEDs. hid: only the DualSense's; xinput: only XInput rumble; 0: none. Read at session start; the game's own file wins.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在(默认)上:在控制器(CoreHaptics)上输入朗布尔游戏，在DualSense HID模式下，游戏的输出报告会驱动朗布尔，适应性触发器(closest Game Controller模式)，灯栏和玩家LED. 隐藏:只有DualSense's;xinput:只有XInput 朗布尔;0:无. 开始会话时读取;游戏自己的文件获胜."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On (default): XInputGetBatteryInformation reports each pad's GameController battery (wired while charging, else a level) and XInputGetCapabilities flags a battery-powered pad as wireless. 0: an unknown battery, as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在( 默认 ) 上:XInputGetBatterry Information 上报了每个垫的游戏控制器电池( 充电时有线，否则是关卡) ,XInputGet Capabilitys 将电池动力的电池垫标记为无线. 0:一个未知电池，和以前一样."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On (default): a 32-bit program's glGetQueryObject*v result pointer is an offset into the bound GL_QUERY_BUFFER (wined3d reads occlusion results that way; converting it as a pointer left the game spinning at 1 fps, ml1340). 0: the old pointer conversion.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在(默认)上:一个32位程序GlGetQuery Object*v结果指针是一个被绑定的GLQQUERY_BUFFER(wined3d读occlation results that way;将其转换为指针离开游戏旋转时为1英尺,ml1340. 0:旧指针转换."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On (default): a session that found no fonts leaves the registry's Fonts key alone, stale external entries that name a font of C:\\windows\\Fonts are dropped, and the Windows directory's fonts get their Fonts values back (DirectWrite lists only those, so without them embedded browsers crash and dialogs draw no text). 0: upstream Wine's font key update. Read at session start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在(默认)上:一个找不到字体的会话将注册处的字体键单独留下，将命名为 C:\\windows\\Fonts 的外部条目丢弃, Windows目录的字体会重新获得字体值( DirectWrite 仅列出字体值，所以没有这些字体的嵌入浏览器崩溃，对话框不会绘制文字) 0 : 上游 Wine 的字体键更新。在会话开始时读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On (default): each Windows process gets its own keyed event for the waits and wakes that pass no handle (RtlRunOnce among them), created on first use. 0: every process uses the one the first process created, as before, whose handle is not valid in the others (Slay the Spire 2 failed in RtlRunOnceComplete). Read once per app run.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在(默认)上:每个 Windows 进程都会为没有手柄的等待和唤醒(RtlRunOnce in其中)获得自己的按键事件，在第一次使用时创建. 0:每个进程都像以前一样使用第一个创建的进程，其手柄在其他进程无效(在RtlRunOnceComplete中Slay the Spire 2失败). Read once on perform app run."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On (default): when a game has switched XInput off (XInputEnable(FALSE), usually on losing focus) but its window is in front, it still reads the pad; activation messages at startup can leave it off for good. 0: the pad reads at rest while disabled, as before. Read by win32u, so 32- and 64-bit games alike.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在(默认)上:当游戏切换了XInput 关机(XInputenable(FALSE)，通常在失去焦点时)，但其窗口仍然位于前方，它仍然读取了垫片;启动时激活消息可以让它永远关闭. 0: 垫片像以前一样在禁用时在休息时读取。通过win32u读取，所以32位和64位的游戏是相同的."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On (default): when player 1's controller reconnects and GameController reports it as a new controller before the old one leaves, it is moved from the slot it landed in back to slot 0. 0: it stays where it landed, as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在(默认)上:当玩家1的控制器重新连接，游戏控制器在旧的控制器离开前作为新的控制器报告时，它从它降落在后方的插槽移动到0.0槽:它和以前一样，停留在它降落的地方."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a computer, make this %@'s pairing file with the [StikDebug pairing-file guide](https://github.com/StikDebug/StikDebug-Guide/blob/main/pairing_file.md).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在电脑上按照 [StikDebug 配对文件指南](https://github.com/StikDebug/StikDebug-Guide/blob/main/pairing_file.md) 为这台 %1$@ 生成配对文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default (500 ms): an identical interface, address or route table read within this many milliseconds reuses the last result. 0 reads the host every time; at most 5000.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认值( 500ms ) : 在许多毫秒内读取的相同接口、 地址或路由表会重用最后的结果。 0每次读取主机; 最多 5000。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default with skin-check. 0: log only, with no GPU copies, which add a copy between the skinning dispatches and the draw (to compare what the frames look like).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下，使用皮肤检查。 0 : 仅日志，没有 GPU 副本，它会在剥皮调度和绘图之间添加一个副本( 比较帧的形状 )。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default. 0: OPTIONS1 reports WaveOps FALSE, so a game with a fallback picks shaders without wave intrinsics (an A/B for the shader converter's wave code; Horizon Zero Dawn reads it). Read once per game start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0: Poptions1报告WaveOps FALSE，所以一个带有倒置背面的游戏会选择没有波内含的阴影(一个A/B用于阴影转换器的波码;Horizon Zero Dawn读取). 每一个游戏开始一次读取."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default. A 32-bit Direct3D 9 game writes its index buffers through a copy Madeira keeps; an indexed draw now copies only the indices it reads into the buffer the GPU reads, instead of the whole buffer before every draw after a lock (the slowdown in engines that lock a little of one big index buffer before each draw, such as Call of Duty's). A lock without NOOVERWRITE still gives the next draw a fresh buffer, so draws already recorded keep what they read. [d3d9-index-range] lines in the log say how much was copied. 0: the whole-buffer copy, as before. Read once per session.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下，一个 32 位 Direct3D 9 游戏通过 Madeira 复制件来写其索引缓冲器;现在一个索引绘图只复制它读入缓冲器的索引，而不是锁后每次绘图前的整个缓冲器( 引擎的减速，在每次绘图前锁定一个大的索引缓冲器，如 Call of Duty )。一个没有 NOODEWRITE 的锁定仍然给下一个绘图一个新的缓冲器，所以绘图已经记录了它们读到的内容。 [d3d9- index-range]行说复制了多少。 0 : 完整缓冲器副本，如以前一样。 一次读一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default. A Direct3D 9 program may render into an L8, A8L8 or L16 texture (one-channel targets for ambient occlusion, blur passes or masks), as native drivers and DXVK allow; DXMT used to refuse the texture, and a program that builds such targets through its engine's format table then got none and could sit on its loading screen for good. The storage is R8Unorm, RG8Unorm or R16Unorm, renderable on every Metal GPU; the shader's .r lands in the luminance channel and samples read back as (L, L, L, 1). 0: refuse them, as before. Read once per session.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下, Direct3D 9 程序可能会像本地驱动器和 DXVK 允许的那样，将 L8, A8L8 或 L16 纹理( 环境隔离、 模糊通道或口罩的单通道目标); DXMT 用于拒绝纹理，并且通过引擎格式表构建这类目标的程序，然后没有结果，并且可以永远坐在其装入屏幕上。 存储是 R8Unorm, RG8Unorm 或 R16Unorm，在每个金属 GPU 上都可以转换; 遮荫器的.r 降落在光线通道和样本中读回( L, L, L, 1) 0 : 拒绝它们，如以前一样。每场读一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default. A whole render-target or depth-stencil clear becomes the clear the next render pass that draws to that target starts with: a clear no longer ends the pass in progress unless it is one of that pass's own targets, and needs no pass of its own (which wrote the whole target to memory and read it back later). A barrier or copy that names the cleared texture, or a pass or clear that uses it through another view, applies the clear first, so nothing sees it uncleared. 0: every clear ends the open pass and goes before the next pass on its own, as before. Read once per game start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下，一个完整的渲染目标或深度刻度清晰就成为了下一个渲染目标所传递的清晰度:一个清晰度不再结束正在传递，除非它是该传递的目标之一，并且不需要自己的传递(它将整个目标写成内存，然后读出它 )。一个屏障或复制来命名已清除的纹理，或者通过另一个视图使用它，应用清晰度第一，所以没有任何东西看到它没有清晰度。 0:每一个清晰度结束开放的传承，然后像以前一样在下一个传承之前进行。每次游戏开始后读一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default. MADEIRA_ARENA_GUARD=0 lets a fixed or hinted guest reservation take FEX arena space again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下, MADEIRA_ ARENA_ GUARD=0 允许固定或提示的客人预定再次占用 FEX 竞技场空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default. MADEIRA_THREAD_REUSE=0 never gives a full thread registry's exited or purged entries to new threads (a session again registers 512 threads at most).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下, MADEIRA_ THREAD_ REUSE=0 从未给全线程登记簿的退出或清除项给新线程( 最多一次会话登记512条线程)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default. MFC comes from the same Microsoft VC++ package as the C++ runtime and is linked into the game's system32; games that import it (Horizon Zero Dawn) stop at once without it. Wine has no MFC of its own. 0 leaves it out. Read at session start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下, MFC 来源于与 C++ 运行时相同的 Microsoft VC++ 包，并链接到游戏的系统32; 导入它的游戏( Horizon Zero Dawn) 立即停止，没有它。 Wine 本身没有 MFC。 0 省略它。在会话开始时读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default. The Direct3D 12 runtime's shader cache (AppData\\Local\\Madeira\\ShaderCache) is read and written by Madeira itself instead of through Wine's file calls, which asked Wine's server three times per entry (~3.5 ms each in Horizon Zero Dawn's menu, ~1,000 entries a second, with the server on a performance core). The same files either way. 0: Wine's file calls, as before. Read when the game creates its first pipeline.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下, Direct3D 12 运行时的遮蔽缓存( AppData\\ Local\\Madeira\\ShaderCache) 由Madeira自己读写，而不是通过Wine的文件呼叫,Wine的每个条目向Wine的服务器询问了3次(在Horizon Zero Dawn的菜单中，每次询问3次~3.5ms，每秒输入1 000个条目，服务器位于一个性能核心). 0: Wine的文件调用，和以前一样. 游戏创建其第一个管道时读取."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default. When a program of the session exits (a launcher restarting itself, RockstarService.exe, a setup step), the emulator's code buffers it held go back to the JIT pool: reusable 3 seconds later, once no thread runs in them. Before, they stayed in use until Madeira closed, and a game started after many such exits got 16 MB code buffers and ran slowly. 0 keeps them in use, as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下。当会话程序退出时( 启动器重新启动自身, RockstarService. exe，设置步骤)，它所持有的代码缓冲器会返回到 JIT 池: 3秒后，一旦没有线程在其中运行，它们就会继续使用，直到 Madeira 关闭，许多这样的退出后，游戏会启动 16 MB 代码缓冲器并慢跑。 0 保持它们像以前一样使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default. While Madeira is not the active app, any thread other than the app's main thread that commits a Metal command buffer waits until Madeira is back, so a game that keeps loading in the background (Zink OpenGL, Direct3D, Vulkan) never sends GPU work iOS refuses and never loses its device. [metal-bg] lines in the log. 0: not installed. Read at app start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下, Madeira 并不是活动应用程序，但除该应用程序主线程之外，执行金属指令缓冲器的线程会等待 Madeira 返回，因此一个继续装入背景的游戏( Zink OpenGL, Direct3D, Vulkan) 从未发送 GPU 工作 iOS 拒绝，也从未丢失其设备。 [metal- bg] 线路在日志中 : 0 :未安装。在 app 启动时读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default: a 64-bit game started beside 32-bit helpers keeps memory it frees and allocates again soon in RAM instead of the swap file, until less than MADEIRA_SWAP_CHURN_TIGHT_MB is left before the memory limit. 0: that memory goes to the donor pool or the swap file like the rest (slower once the device is out of free RAM). Read at session start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下:在32位帮助者旁边开始的64位游戏将内存保存自由，并很快在RAM中再次分配，而不是交换文件，直到在内存限制之前还剩下不到MADEIRA_SWAP_CHURN_TIGHT_MB. 0:内存会像其他的一样进入捐献者池或交换文件(一旦设备用完免费RAM后会减少)。在会话开始时读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default: a game that plays 5.1 or 7.1 sound has every channel folded into the two speakers, so voices (in the centre channel), bass and the rear channels are heard. Off keeps only the front left and right channels, as Madeira did before, which loses most dialogue in a surround game. Applies at the next game start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下:一个演奏5.1或7.1声音的游戏将每个频道折叠到两个扬声器中，所以声音(在中央频道)，低音和后方频道都被听到. Off只保留前左和右频道，就像Madeira之前那样，这在围棋中失去了大多数对话框. 应用在下一个游戏启动时."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default: a guest's anonymous RWX data heap (Mono's Boehm GC) is plain read/write memory. 0 maps it through the JIT pool again, with every store emulated, as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下:一个嘉宾的匿名RWX数据堆(Mono's Boehm GC)是普通读/写记忆. 0再次通过JIT池绘制地图，每个商店都仿照，和以前一样."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default: an async I/O completion for a busy thread goes to a waiting thread of its process, if there is one, instead of failing the I/O. 0 always drops it again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下:繁忙线程的ASync I/O补全到其过程的等待线程，如果有的话，而不是失败 I/O. 0 总是再次放弃."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default: an overwrite (supersede, overwrite, overwrite-if) through a link to a read-only file replaces the link with a new file. 0 fails it with access denied.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下:通过链接到一个只读文件的覆盖( supersede, overwrite, overwrite-if) 将链接替换为新文件。 0 无法访问它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default: memory a game frees and allocates again soon takes donor RAM while the pool has room, instead of counting against the app's memory limit. 0: it stays in the app's own memory as before. Read at session start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下: 游戏将再次释放和分配内存，很快在池子有空间时使用捐赠者RAM，而不是在应用的内存限制下计数。 0 :它会像以前一样留在应用自己的内存中。在会话开始时读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default: programs see this device's network interfaces, IP addresses and routes. 0 serves none of them, as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下: 程序会看到此设备的网络接口, IP地址和路由. 0 和以前一样，无法为其中任何服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default: the Settings tab lists its pages, each opening the sections it holds. 0: the one long page with every section, as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下: 设置标签列出其页面，每个打开它所持有的段落。 0 :每个段落的长页，和以前一样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default: when a game in a Madeira Dock session asks Steam to start another game (steam.exe with steam://run/<App ID>, as Black Ops II's campaign does for Zombies), steam.exe is not started and Madeira starts that game when it is next opened. 0 lets steam.exe start as before (the full Steam client, which updates itself and stops at a black window in a Dock session).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下:当一个Madeira码头会话中的游戏要求Steam启动另一游戏(steam.exe with sour://run/<App ID>，正如黑Ops II的竞选活动对僵尸所做的那样)时,sour.exe没有启动，而Madeira在下一次打开时开始该游戏. 0让sour.exe开始如前(完整的Steam客户端，该客户端更新自己，并在Dock会话中的黑窗口中停止)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default: without \\\\.\\Nsi, an address-change request stays pending (the addresses do not change) instead of failing at once. 0 fails it as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下:没有\\\\\\.\\ Nsi，地址更改请求将待处理( 地址不更改)，而不是一次失败。 0 将像以前一样失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default: without \\\\.\\Nsi, the failed open is remembered instead of being retried on every call. 0 retries every time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下:没有\\\\\\.\\ Nsi，失败的打开会被记住，而不是在每次通话中被重审。每一次0 重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default; 0 turns it off. SocialClubHelper.exe runs --single-process with PartitionAllocBackupRefPtr disabled and V8 --jitless (MADEIRA_JITLESS = 0 keeps V8's JIT), its --type= children are refused, and a process with socialclub.dll mapped that is not the helper (the game) gets no JIT-pool copy of libcef.dll: its load fails, as it did when the pool was full. No effect on programs without Social Club.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下, 0 关闭它。 SocialClubHelper.exe 运行 - single- process with Partition AllocBackup RefPtr 已禁用, V8 - jitless (MADEIRA_JITLESS = 0 保持 V8的JIT)，其 -- type= 儿童被拒绝，使用 Socialclub. dll 映射的不是帮助者(游戏) 的 libcef.dll 的 JIT- pool 程序: 负载失败，如池满时一样。没有社交俱乐部，对程序没有效果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On iOS 26 and later, Steam downloads continue in the background as a continued-processing task that iOS shows with its progress. 0: only the short grace period, then a clean pause until Madeira is active again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在iOS 26及之后,Steam的下载在背景中继续作为iOS随其进展而显示的继续处理任务. 0:只有短暂的宽限期，然后一个干净的暂停，直到Madeira再次活动."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On: x64 games get Mesa's opengl32.dll (OpenGL 3.3 on D3D12, then Metal) when build/mesa-d3d12/build.sh has put it in the app. 0: Wine's builtin opengl32, which uses the native WGL OpenGL ES/Zink route. A game folder's own opengl32.dll still wins. Read at session start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在:x64游戏在构建/mesa-d3d12/build.sh时获得Mesa的opengl32.dll(OpenGL 3.3 on D3D12，然后是Metal)，将其放入应用中. 0:Wine的civilin opengl32，它使用本地的WGL OpenGL ES/Zink路由. 游戏文件夹自己的opengl32.dll仍然获胜，在会话开始时读取."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once Wine points stderr at madeira-log.txt, the app's own log lines are written through stderr too (appendToFile); 0 keeps a per-call file handle.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一旦Wine在madeira-log.txt上点出stderr，该app自己的日志行也会通过stderr写入(附录ToFile);0保留每个调用的文件控件."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One Metal call per encoder, not per draw": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个编码器一个金属调用，而不是每个绘图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One Wine session per app run (see LibraryModel.sessionsThisRun).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个应用程序运行一个Wine会话(参见 LibraryModel.sessions ThisRun)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One row": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "单行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One-shot env-var read. DXMT_DUMP_D9_SHADER=1 enables a per-create summary line via Logger::warn (so it shows up in d3d9.log alongside the first-call traces). Off by default to avoid unconditional spam from apps that create hundreds of sh...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一击即刻读. DXMT_DUMP_D9_SHADER=1通过Logger:warn(因此它以d3d9.log显示，与第一调的痕迹并列)，默认可以避免从创建数百 sH的应用程序中无条件的垃圾邮件. ."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only stamped locks": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有盖章的锁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only stamped locks (default)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有盖章的锁( 默认)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only with env.MADEIRA_FPS_GOV_MW set: how much energy the running balance may drift above or below the target before the cap moves one step (100-100000; unset or out of range: 1500). Smaller moves the cap sooner and more often. Read at session start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅使用 env.MADEIRA_FPS_GOV_MW 设置: 运行平衡在移动一个步骤( 100- 100 000;未设置或超出范围:1500) 之前，会在目标上下移动多少能量。 移动时会更早，频率更小。在会话开始时读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only with env.MADEIRA_FPS_GOV_MW set: the highest frame cap the governor uses, the largest of 60, 40, 30, 24 and 20 at or below this value (20 when lower). Unset: 60. Read at session start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅使用 env.MADEIRA_FPS_GOV_MW 设置:州长使用的最高框架上限，最大值为60,40,30,24和20，此值或以下(20当下). Unset:60.在会话开始时读取."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only with env.MADEIRA_FPS_GOV_MW set: the lowest frame cap the governor goes down to, the smallest of 60, 40, 30, 24 and 20 at or above this value, never above the highest cap. Unset: 20. Read at session start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅使用 env.MADEIRA_FPS_GOV_MW 设置: 州长下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下至下"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings › Privacy & Security › Developer Mode, scroll down and tap **Pair with %@**.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开「设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 开发者模式」，向下滚动并点按 **与 %1$@ 配对**。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenGL backend for the winios GL driver (build/win32u-unix/opengl_ios.c): zink - desktop OpenGL 3.3-4.x: Mesa OSMesa + Zink on MoltenVK, from the bundle's gl/ folder (build/mesa-ios, build/moltenvk-ios) gles - Apple's OpenGL ES 3.0 (EAGL...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "winios GL 驱动程序(building/win32u-unix/opengl_ios.c)的 OpenGL后端: zink - 桌面 OpenGL 3.3-4.x: Mesa OSMEsa + MoltenVK上的 Zink，来自捆绑的gl/文件夹(building/mesa-ios,build/mltenvk-ios) gles - 苹果公司的 OpenGL ES 3.0(EAGL..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenGL through Mesa on D3D12": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 D3D12 上的 OpenGL通过 Mesa"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opt-in (MADEIRA_DINPUT_TRACE=1) and limited by a PROCESS-wide call counter: the per-device millisecond limiter never engaged for a title that re-creates its device constantly, and 260,000 trace lines in one session cost more than the inp...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opt-in(MADEIRA_DINPUT_TRACE=1)，并受到全过程调用计数器的限制:每设备毫秒限制器从未为不断重制其设备的标题而使用过，一个会话中的26万微量线成本比Inp多. ."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opt-in (default off). Serves tiny GetRenderTargetData readbacks, such as a 1x1 exposure sample, one frame late instead of waiting on the GPU. Applies to 32-bit D3D9 games that read a small render target back every frame.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opt- in( 默认关闭)。 服务于小的 GetRenderTargetData 读取，如 1x1 曝光样本，一个帧延迟，而不是等待 GPU。 应用到32位的 D3D9 游戏，读取每个帧的小型渲染目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opt-in (env.MADEIRA_DEVICE_STATS = 1): a line every 10 s during every session is a diagnostic, so it is off by default.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opt-in(env.MADEIRA_DEVICE_STATS = 1):每会话中每10秒有一行是诊断，所以默认关闭."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opt-in `env.MADEIRA_THERMAL_CAP = 1`: when iOS reports the device as serious or critical, a session paced at the 60 cap, MAX or RAW drops to the 40 cap (three refreshes at 120 Hz, so evenly spaced; the 30 cap where 40 is not offered). A ...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 `env.MADEIRA_THERMAL_CAP = 1` 可启用。iOS 报告设备温度达到严重或危急等级时，原本以 60、MAX 或 RAW 模式运行的会话降至 40 帧率上限（120 Hz 下每三次刷新显示一帧，间隔均匀）。无法使用 40 时降至 30…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opt-in diagnostics: DXMT_CACHE_STATS=1 logs hit/miss counts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opt-in诊断:DXMT_CACHE_STATS=1日志命中/误数."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opt-in per launch: a 512 MB JIT pool instead of the standard one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次发射的Opt-in:一个512 MB JIT池而不是标准的一个."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opt-out only: this strictly removes a dependency on a port we do not own, so it defaults ON. MADEIRA_TASK_EXC=0 restores the pre-ml522 behaviour for a same-build A/B against the ~54s stall.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只退出:这严格取消了对一个我们没有的端口的依赖，因此它默认为 ON. MADEIRA_TASK_EXC=0 恢复一个同建的 A/B对 ~54s 拖放的 Ml522 行为。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional MADEIRA_ARGS: Windows command-line quoting (CommandLineToArgvW rules), at most 64 arguments in 4 KB. Malformed or oversized input fails the launch instead of silently dropping or splitting arguments.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可选的MADEIRA_ARGS:Windows命令行引用(CommandLineToArgvW rules)，最多在 4 KB 中64 个参数. 输入格式不当或大小过大，导致启动失败，而不是默不作声地丢弃或分割参数."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional bytecode-to-disk dump. Empty -> disabled. Set to a writable directory path; we write one file per unique bytecode hash, so the session ends with a directory containing every shader the app created.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可选字节码到磁盘堆放。 空 -> 已禁用。 设定为可写字的目录路径;我们每个独有的字节码散列写一个文件，因此会话以包含每个创建的应用程序的阴影的目录结尾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orphan-lock reaper mode": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "孤儿锁收割者模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Other": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其他"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overlay style": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
