    "Register win32u's NtUser / NtGdi syscall table in slot 1. Activating this causes user32 process_attach to crash until wineserver shared-memory bringup is complete; gated on the MADEIRA_WIN32U env var so we can flip it on for debugging.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "注册 win32u 的 NtUser / NtGdi syscall表在 1 槽中启用此功能会导致用户 32 进程_attach 崩溃，直到 Wine服务器共享- 模拟 启动完成 ;在 MADEIRA_ WIN32U env var 上打开，这样我们就可以打开它进行调试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
