    "Still nothing: a 32-bit client with several 32-bit helpers can need more windows than the band holds. [0x7400000000, 0x7c00000000) is kept for a 64-bit Chromium's PartitionAlloc pools, which a 32-bit client does not use. Spill into it to...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仍然没什么:一个拥有多个32位助手的32位客户端比乐队持有的要需要更多的窗口. [0x74000000, 0x7c000000000] 是为一个64位的Chromium's PartitionAlloc 集合而保存的，一个32位客户端没有使用. 溢入其中."
          }
        }
      }
    },
