            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dock会话没有开始。请参看日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The QoS class guest threads run at while eco is on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "QoS级客串在生态上运行时运行."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Visual C++ 2015-2022 runtime is installed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装 Visual C++ 2015–2022 运行库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Vulkan driver Wine's winevulkan loads: moltenvk = gl/libMoltenVK.dylib (the one Zink uses), kosmickrisp = gl/libvulkan_kosmickrisp.dylib, or a .dylib path (absolute or bundle-relative). Setting it turns Vulkan on for x64 programs (vulkan-1.dll and winevulkan.dll in the prefix); unset, Vulkan is off unless d3d12 = vkd3d or d3d11 = dxvk. Read at session start; also from a game's own lines.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vulkan 驱动器 Wine 的 winvulkan 负载 : 熔化vk = gl/libMoltenVK.dylib(其中一种是 Zink 使用的), kosmickrisp = gl/libvulkan_kosmickrisp.dylib，或 .dylib 路径(绝对或捆绑关系)。 设定它为 x64 程序(前缀中的 vulkan-1.dll 和 windvulkan.dl)。 尚未设置, Vulkan 关闭，除非 d3d12 = vkd3d 或 d3d11 = dxvk。在会话开始时读取游戏本身的行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Vulkan driver Zink runs desktop OpenGL (and d3d9 = wined3d) on: MoltenVK (default) or KosmicKrisp (gl/libvulkan_kosmickrisp.dylib); any other value is a .dylib name in the gl folder or an absolute path. env.MADEIRA_GL_VULKAN is the fallback. Read when a program first creates an OpenGL context; the log says \"ml1344 zink Vulkan library: ...\".": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vulkan 驱动程序 Zink 运行桌面 OpenGL(和 d3d9 = wined3d) 上: MoltenVK (默认) 或 KosmicKrisp (gl/libvulkan_kosmickrisp.dylib); 任何其他值都是 gl 文件夹中的.dylib 名称或绝对路径. env. MADEIRA_GL_VULKAN是倒置。当程序首次创建 OpenGL 上下文时读; log 表示\"ml1344 zink Vulkan 库:...\"。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The [vkmt] entry-point trace; MADEIRA_KMT_TRACE=0 turns it off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[vkmt]进站点追踪;MADEIRA_KMT_TRACE=0关闭."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The adapter name Windows reports with MADEIRA_GPU_VENDOR and MADEIRA_GPU_DEVICE; unset, the name of the PCI id. Per game: Game details > Graphics card the game sees.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适配器名称Windows使用MADEIRA_GPU_VENDOR和MADEIRA_GPU_DEVICE进行报告;未设置，名称为PCI id.每款游戏:游戏细节> 图形卡，游戏所看到的."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address range at 0x140000000 kept for a game exe without relocations, which can only run there. Unset: 128 MB, or for a Madeira Dock launch the size of the largest such exe in the game's folder (The Adventures of Elliot: 473 MB -> 480). The JIT pool then starts above it and is that much smaller, so a large one also needs env.MADEIRA_X64_IMAGE_NOCOPY = 1 and pool-split = 1. A number sets it (129 to 960); 128 or less keeps 128 MB. Read at launch, the game's own file wins.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0x140000000的地址范围保留给一个没有迁移的游戏exe，它只能运行在那里. Unset:128 MB，或者一个Madeira Dock 发布游戏文件夹中最大这种exe的大小(The Adventures of Elliot:473 MB -> 480)，然后JIT池从它上面开始，是那么小得多，所以一个大型的游戏还需要env.MADEIRA ⁇ 64_IMAGE_NOCOPY = 1和pool-split = 1. 数字设置(129至960);128或更少保留128 MB. 发布时，游戏自己的文件获胜."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The compiler emits bindings only for sampled stages. Avoid sampler-cache probes, Metal texture-view creation and resource retention for stale bindings outside that mask. Fixed-function combiners retain their path.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编译器只为取样阶段发出绑定。 避免取样器- 缓存探测器、 金属纹理- 视图创建和保存资源，用于遮罩外的stale 绑定。 固定功能组合器保留其路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The compiler's binding pre-scan and this metadata mask use the same dxso_opcode_samples/dxso_sampling_slot helpers (including SM1 implicit stages). Unread slots never enter its signature or lowering. Keeping their live texture kinds in t...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编译器的绑定预扫描和这个元数据掩码使用相同的dxso_opcode_samples/dxso_sampling_slot 帮助器(包括 SM1 隐含的阶段).未读槽从不输入其签名或降低. 保留其活的纹理类型在t..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The data abort's ESR says whether the access wrote (WnR, bit 6). The encoding guess below calls the LSE atomics (LDADD, SWP, CAS...: an x86 lock xadd / xchg) reads, because they have bit 22 set, so a write was reported to the guest as a ...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数据中止的ESR表示访问是否写入(WnR，位6)，下面的编码猜想称LSE atomics(LDAD, SWP, CAS...:一个x86锁xadd / xchg)读取，因为他们有位22的设置，所以一个写法被作为..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The developer interface's Wine desktop size (ml1127); its Resolution menu writes it (ml1157). Madeira Dock sessions without a game's Resolution use it too. Unset: this screen's shape at 1280x720's pixel count (ml1172: 1408x648 on a 19.5:9 iPhone, 1152x800 on an 11-inch iPad). Applies at the next app start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开发者界面的Wine桌面大小(ml1127);其分辨率菜单写它(ml1157)，没有游戏分辨率的Madeira Dock会话也使用它. unset:此屏幕形状为1280x720的像素计数(ml1172:1408x648在19.5:9 iPhone,1152x800在11英寸iPad上). applications at the next appstart."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The executable path or launch arguments are too long.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可执行文件路径或启动参数太长。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file changed while it was open here, so nothing was saved. Go back and open it again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件在此打开时已更改，因此没有保存任何文件。 回去再打开它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game is starting. Waiting for its window…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在启动游戏，等待游戏窗口…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game's launch arguments are invalid or too long. Edit them in Game details and try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏的发布参数无效或太长，在游戏细节中编辑并再次尝试."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The host surface can measure its size in other units than the client rect (an iOS CAMetalLayer reports points), so the host may call a swapchain suboptimal although it matches the window's client rect. The application cannot fix that: a ...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机表面可以在客户端矩形以外的单位(一个iOS CAMetalLayer报告点)中测量其大小，所以主机可以称交换链为次优化，尽管它与窗口的客户端矩形相匹配. 应用程序不能修正: a."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The in-game Aspect & scaling choice sticks to the game. MADEIRA_SESSION_TOOLS=0 hides that picker and leaves the stored choice alone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏中的视角和缩放选择棒对游戏. MADEIRA_SESSION_TOOLS=0隐藏了拾取者，而将存储的选择单独留下."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The in-game menu's Diagnostics (frame capture, GPU sync), for testing: off unless madeira.cfg sets env.MADEIRA_SESSION_DIAGNOSTICS = 1. A capture writes render-target pixels to Documents/capture, which Files shows.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏中菜单的诊断(帧捕获,GPU同步)，用于测试:关闭，除非makeira.cfg sets env.MADEIRA_SESSION_DIAGNOSTICS = 1. 捕获会写成渲染目标像素到文档/抓取，文件会显示."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The install record lists per-user executables: Dock asks Valve's client to prepare them before it launches. env.MADEIRA_DOCK_CEG = 0 never asks.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装记录列表为每个用户可执行文件: Dock要求Valve的客户端在启动前准备. env.MADEIRA_DOCK_CEG=0 永不问."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The install scripts' programs of a game: its own folder (one level down) and the shared redistributables Steam keeps next to it, and how many scripts were read.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装脚本的游戏程序:它自己的文件夹(一个级别下)和共享的可再分配器Steam保存在旁边，以及读取了多少脚本."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The largest new reservation the swap tier backs whole: 256 MB in wide (at most 4 GB), 8 GB in broad (at most 16 GB). 9216 with broad coverage (swap-mode = 2) also backs Red Dead Redemption 2's 8960 MB heap with the file. Read at session start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "交换层最大新保留层整体:宽256 MB(最多4 GB)，宽8 GB(最多16 GB). 9216 具有宽覆盖(wap-mode = 2)的还背红死救赎 2 8960 MB 堆与文件，在会话开始时读取."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library's ambient light: a glow behind every grid card that has reported its frame (only the cards the lazy grids have built). MADEIRA_LIBRARY_AMBIENT=0 turns it off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "库的环境灯:每张已报告其帧的网格卡(只有懒网所建的网格)后面都有一道光芒. MADEIRA_LIBRARY_AMBIENT=0关机."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library's store tabs: with Group by Platform, a segmented control at the top of the page shows one store's section at a time (Steam, the games you added, GOG, itch.io, Epic Games, EA app) or All of them. Only the sections the page wo...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "库的商店标签: 以 Group by Platform 显示，页面顶端的一个分区控件显示一个商店的区段( Steam，您添加的游戏, GOG, itch.io, Epic Games, EA app) 或全部的区段。只显示页面 wo..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The limit is MEASURED, not assumed: os_proc_available_memory() is what remains before jetsam, and TASK_VM_INFO.phys_footprint is what is already charged, so their sum is this process's effective total. Cached on first use so the advertis...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "限制是 MEASURED，而不是假设: os_ proc_ assessive_memory ()是喷射萨姆之前的剩余部分, TASK_VM_INFO.phys_ footprint是已经充电的部分，所以它们的总和是这个过程的有效总量。 第一次使用时被卡住，所以广告..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The native frontend (DXMT_MADEIRA) has no user32 boundary and always uses the internal singleton.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原生前端(DXMT_MADEIRA)没有用户32的边界，并且总是使用内部的单子."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The opt-in above; read when a session's pacing is applied.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上方的选入; 应用会话间隔时读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same frozen page makes every \"N ms have passed since X\" test in a guest false for the life of the process: a headless host that sits online and re-checks a condition \"5 s after sign-in\" never reaches its check, and its own 90 s wall-...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同一被冻结的页面使得每个\"Nms\"在X的测试中都通过过一个客串的假测试，对于这个过程的生命:一个坐在线并重新检查一个条件\"签到后5s\"的无头主机永远不会到达它的检查，它自己的90s的墙——......"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shader translators' log level (none, err, warn, fixme, info, trace); with d3d12 = vkd3d.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遮蔽翻译的日志级别(无，错误，警告，定me，信息，追踪);带有d3d12=vkd3d."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shared-mode engine period, in 100 ns units. A client that keeps one period queued (IAudioClient3) must cover a whole RemoteIO slice, or every render callback empties its queue and plays silence for the rest: at least two slices of th...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共享模式引擎周期，单位为100 ns。一个客户端保留一个周期的队列( IAudioClient3)，必须覆盖整个远程IO片段，或者每个渲染的回调会空空其队列，并播放其余部分的静态:至少两个片段的th..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The smallest allocation the swap tier backs (ml1257): 8 MB in classic, 1 MB in blocks and wide, 4 MB in broad unless set. MADEIRA_SWAP_MIN_KB overrides it for blocks, wide and broad.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "互换级后置最小分配(ml1257) : 8 MB 经典, 1 MB 块和宽, 4 MB 宽，除非设置. MADEIRA_ SWAP_ MIN_ KB 覆盖它，宽和宽的块。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The video memory budget a game reads shrinks as memory runs short (vram-trim-mb), judged by the app's own memory. 1: the donor pool's memory counts as well, since it is the device's RAM even though it is not under the app's limit, so with a full pool on a phone with less RAM the game is told to keep fewer textures. Off by default (a test option). Read at session start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "视频内存预算 游戏读取收缩，因为内存短( vram- trim-mb)，由 app 自身的内存 判断. 1: 捐献池的内存也算数，因为设备的内存虽然不在 app 的 限值 下，但它在手机上有一个完整的 池，且内存较少。 游戏被告知要保存更少的纹理。 默认关闭( 测试选项)。在会话开始时读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no connection, and Steam refused to sign in offline. Connect to the internet and start the game once. Export the log if it happens again.": {
