    "a live mirror, which is why four of five stalled threads reported rip=0. * Selector mirrors is_inside_syscall() exactly: kernel_stack <= sp <= syscall_frame. NOT \"native pc is not EC\" -- FEX JIT code is also non-EC but its frame may be s...": {
