    "iOS-Madeira Round 7 (2026-07-04): de-fault the unix-call path. Pool-executing EC callers read this slot and `blr` its value. With the baseline PE VA they exec-fault (~100 Mach round trips/present, ~0.5ms wall each = the bulk of the gamep...": {
