    "iOS-Madeira: no system root store API on iOS. WineProcessBridge.m points MADEIRA_CA_BUNDLE at the bundled Mozilla cacert.pem (concatenated PEM — same format as ca-certificates.crt, which import_certs_from_file already parses).": {
