      }
    },
    "ml1150: RAM for the swap tier that is not counted against Madeira's limit, donated by the MadeiraMemoryHost extension (512 MB regions, created untouched, handed over, then the extension exits). With swap-mb it is the swap tier's first stage, taken before the swap file; without swap-mb it is the only stage (ml2200 donor-only, madeira.cfg donor-only = 0 turns that off) and what it cannot cover stays normal app memory. Taken while free RAM stays above MADEIRA_DONOR_POOL_MARGIN_MB and iOS reports no memory pressure. Off by default; read at launch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml1150: 互换级的RAM，不计入Madeira的极限，由 Madeira MemoryHost 扩展( 512 MB 区域，创建、 移交，然后扩展退出)。在互换-mb 中，它是互换级的第一阶段，在互换文件之前取用;没有互换-mb，它是唯一的阶段(ml2200 仅捐者,madeira. cfg 仅捐者= 0 关闭)，以及它无法覆盖的保持正常的应用程序内存。在免费RAM 保留在 MADEIRA_ DONOR_POOL_MARGIN_MB 和 iOS 上时，它没有显示内存压力。 默认情况下;在启动时读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml1150: the donor pool takes no more memory while the host's free RAM is below this many MB. Off (0) since ml2021: iOS keeps free RAM low on purpose, so 1024 and then 256 refused most takes on device; the memory-pressure notification alone guards. Set 256 to restore the old floor.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml1150:当主机的免费RAM低于这么多MB时，捐献池不再占用内存. Off (0)自ml2021: iOS 保持免费RAM 故意低调，因此1024和256拒绝了大多数设备; 内存压力通知单独守护. Set 256以恢复旧的地板."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml1150: the old lifetime count penalized an asynchronous culling loop after its third check, even if those checks were a frame apart. Keep cooperative back-pressure for tight polling only. A 250us gap starts a new burst; completed querie...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml1150: 旧寿命计数在第三次检查后惩罚了同步的挤压循环，即使这些检查是相隔的框。 只能为紧凑的投票保持合作的反压。 250年的间隔会引发新的破裂; 完成的querie..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml1152: how the extension creates each donated region. ledger (the default): a named memory entry tagged to the extension's ledger. purgeable: a purgeable allocation in the extension named by a memory entry (the way MeloNX donates RAM). Everything else in the tier is the same, so the two can be compared.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml1152: 扩展如何创建每个被捐赠区域. 分类账(默认) : 标记在扩展分类账上的已命名内存条目。可清除 : 由内存条目命名的扩展中可清除的配置( MeloNX 如何捐赠RAM)。 级别中的其他所有内容都是一样的，因此可以比较两者。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
