            "value": "ml1310: Windows 报告一经写出( 其私人副本已存在) 复制写成的图像页。 Wine映射图像页可以从开始写到无法显示，所以它总是说 WRITECOPY; V8 CHECKs 表示旗帜 pag..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml1310: the whole pseudo-process ends, as on Windows (idea from the published patch 0058 of another iOS port). Ending only the thread left a half-dead process behind: a browser helper without its renderer thread stays up and is never res...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml1310:整个伪进程结束，如同在Windows上(从另一个iOS端口的已公布的补丁0058中得出的想法). 结束时只留下一条半死进程:一个没有其渲染器线程的浏览器帮助器会一直停留在上，并且永远不会被解析."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml1310: with MADEIRA_FEX_AVX=1 FEX runs AVX/AVX2 and its CPUID says so, but Wine fills the XSAVE configuration only on x86 hosts, so GetEnabledXStateFeatures still said \"no AVX\" and runtimes that ask it (.NET's JIT) kept AVX off. Describ...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml1310:随着MADEIRA_FE ⁇ AV ⁇ 1 FEX运行AVX/AVX2，其CPUID也表示如此，但Wine只在x86主机上填充XSAVE配置，因此GetEnabledX StateFeatures仍然说\"没有AVX\"，并且运行时要求它(.NET的JIT)保持了AVX. Describ..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml1356: do not start a process on the SHARED ntdll copy. Its .data (PEB-derived loader state, module list, loader lock) belongs to another process: device log 95's conhost (started by a 32-bit browser's AllocConsole while the JIT pool wa...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml1356:不要在 shaled ntdll 复制上启动进程。它的. data( PEB 衍生的加载器状态，模块列表，加载器锁) 属于另一个进程: 设备日志 95 的宿主( 由 32 位浏览器的 AllocConsole 启动，而 JIT 池 wa...)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml1357: the full Windows Steam client (steam.exe, started by the in-session launcher or a library entry) runs its own crash reporter, hardware survey and GPU probes. These names were refused because, before ml937, a helper's crash or sel...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml1357:完整的Windows Steam客户端(steam.exe，由会话内启动器或库条目启动)运行自己的崩溃报告器，硬件调查和GPU探测器.这些名称被拒绝是因为在ml937之前，一个帮助者崩溃或sel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml1930: physical and touch controller snapshots share the same serial publisher. Slot/profile/timer state belongs exclusively to `queue`. The app lifecycle and observer registration belong to the main actor. Guest readers use the C snaps...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml1930：实体和触控手柄的快照共用同一串行发布器。槽位、配置和计时器状态仅归 `queue` 管理。应用生命周期和观察者注册在主执行器上处理。客户机通过 C 快照读取…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml1970: FORMAT_SUPPORT below already reports UAV_TYPED_LOAD for every uncompressed colour format (Metal read-write textures), but this option stays FALSE by default: reporting it can move an engine that already runs onto different render...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml1970: FORMAT_SUPPORT 下方已经针对每个未压缩的颜色格式(Metal read-writetextures)报告 UAV_TYPED_LOAD，但这个选项默认保留了 FALSE: 报告它可以将已经运行到不同渲染上的引擎移动到不同的渲染上..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml1970: charge used bytes and trim sparse small captures, so retention and the pressure submit follow real work. MADEIRA_D3D9_BATCH_USED=0 restores ml1960's capacity charge and 8 MiB threshold.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml1970:用电荷的字节和trim稀疏的小捕捉，所以保留和压力提交都跟随真实工作. MADEIRA_D3D9_BATCH_USED=0恢复ml1960的容量电荷和8米B阈值."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml1970: while editing, a Done button ends the edit (keeping it in the active custom layout) in place of the checkmark, and the show/hide glyph is hidden. MADEIRA_CONTROLS_EDITOR_DONE=0 restores the previous bar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml1970:编辑时，一个Done 按钮将编辑(保留在活动自定义布局中)替换为检查标记，显示/隐藏 glyph被隐藏. MADEIRA_CONTROLS_EDITOR_DONE=0恢复了上一个栏."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml1990: one conversion call instead of two. The size-then-fill protocol ran the whole compiler for the size query and again for the fill (the DXIL path had no cache to catch the second). A first buffer of four times the input plus 64 KB ...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml1990:一个转换调用而不是两个. 大小-当时的填充协议运行整个编译器进行大小查询，并再次进行填充( DXIL 路径没有缓存可抓第二个)。第一个缓冲器为输入量的四倍加64 KB..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2020: bytes at the top of the arena the ARM64EC module's requests leave alone, for a 32-bit program that starts later in the session: its WoW64 module asks for the hardware band and nothing else, so when the 64-bit launcher chain has f...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2020:在竞技场顶端的字节 ARM64EC 模块的请求单独离开，为一个在会话后期开始的32位程序:其WoW64 模块要求硬件波段和没有其它，所以当64位的发射机链有f时. ."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2020: hold the panel at 60 Hz under the 60 and 30 caps too. Without any display link a ProMotion iPhone lets the panel idle once nothing drives it: a 32-bit title under the 60 cap presented at a steady 9.9 FPS with the GPU 1% busy, eve...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2020:在60和30个盖子下将面板按60赫兹。没有任何显示链接, Promotion iPhone让面板闲置，一旦无物驱动它: 60个盖子下的一个32位标题，在平稳的9.9 FPS中呈现, GPU 1% 忙碌，前夕..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2021 A/B: 1 leaves the game's Metal layer in CoreAnimation's display-sync scheduling. Off (the default) sets the private displaySyncEnabled=false (the MeloNX pattern, 2026-07-03). For a title parked 18-72 ms a frame in nextDrawable with the display link honoured at 120 Hz, this is one of the two suspects for late drawables (the other: env.MADEIRA_PROMOTE_KICK).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2021 A/B: 1 将游戏的金属层留在了 CoreAnimation 的显示-同步调度中. Off(默认) 设置了私人显示SyncEnabled=false(MeloNX模式, 2026-07-03).对于一个停在下一个Drawable中的18-72ms一个框架与120 Hz的显示链接，这是两个延迟可提取的嫌疑人之一(另一个是env.MADEIRA_PROMOTE_KICK)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2021 experiment: 1 adds a one-pixel layer whose opacity alternates on every display-link tick, so each tick commits a CoreAnimation transaction. For a title parked 80 ms a frame in nextDrawable with the 120 Hz link armed: if the waits fall with this on, the compositor needed a transaction, not an intent.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2021 实验:1 增加了一个单像素层，每个显示链接勾选时其不透明替代，所以每个勾选时都会执行一个 CoreAnimation 交易。对于一个标题，将 80 ms 与 120 Hz 链接武装的下一个可拖曳框:如果等待时间与此相伴, comositor 需要一个交易，而不是一个意图。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2021: 1 maps every donated region into the address space when it is registered, as the first port did. Off (the default) maps only the range being freed, for its zeroing: the permanent windows were placed before Wine held the 32-bit guest-window slot and took it, so 32-bit programs failed at guest-window-reserve.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2021: 注册时每个捐赠区域都会像第一个端口一样在地址空间中映射1幅地图。 关闭( 默认) 的地图只映射被释放的范围，因为其零: 永久窗口在Wine 持有 32 位的宾窗插槽并取下它之前被放置，因此 32 位程序在宾窗保留区失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2021: off (the default) sends a 64-bit program's short-lived allocation sizes to the swap file too while a 32-bit program is in the session, instead of leaving them anonymous (the ml1258 churn filter): beside a 32-bit title the launcher chain is idle, and its anonymous pages were compressed into the footprint. 1 keeps the filter for them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2021:关闭(默认)当一个32位程序在会话中时，也会向交换文件发送一个64位程序的短寿命分配大小，而不是让他们匿名(ml1258churn filter):除了一个32位标题外，发射器链是闲置的，其匿名页面被压缩到脚印中. 1为他们保留了过滤器."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2021: the stage a 64-bit program's memory takes first; the other is the fallback. Unset: the swap file while a 32-bit program is in the session (a guest window held or in use), so the kernel can evict the launcher chain's idle pages and the donor pool stays for the 32-bit program, which may not use the file; donor RAM first otherwise. 1: donor RAM first, always (the old behaviour). 2: the swap file first, always.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2021:一个64位程序的内存首先占据的阶段;另一个是倒置. 取消设置:一个32位程序处于会话中时的互换文件(一个持有或使用中的客户机窗口)，因此内核可以将发射链的闲页驱逐，并且为32位程序保留共享内存池，而32位程序可能不会使用文件;捐助者RAM先使用其他程序. 1:捐助者RAM先，总是(旧行为). 2:交换文件先，永远."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2021: what iOS's memory-pressure notification does to the pool. Unset: nothing, the pool is spent like MeloNX's (on an 8 GB phone the critical notification refused 502 takes and left 2.6 GB of the pool unused while the title's own memory, compressed, filled the app's limit; donated pages are the extension's to compress, not the app's). 1: a critical notification stops takes. 2: warning and critical (the old behaviour).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2021: iOS的内存压力通知对池的作用. unset: nothing，池子像 MeloNX 一样花费(在8 GB 手机上，批判性通知拒绝了 502 取用，并留下了 2.6 GB 的池子未使用，而标题本身的内存，压缩，填充了应用程序的极限; 捐赠的页面是扩展来压缩，而不是应用程序的) 1: 批判性通知需要停止. 2: 警告和批判( 旧行为)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2021: what the tier may do with memory a 32-bit program commits (inside its WoW64 guest window). Unset: donor RAM only, the memory stays ordinary RAM when the pool has none; it never goes to the swap file, which paged a 32-bit title's heap in and out of flash and froze it for seconds at a time. 1: donor RAM, then the swap file, like 64-bit programs (the old behaviour). 2: never tiered. The 64-bit launcher and helpers next to it still use the pool and the file.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2021: 级与32位程序的内存( 在其WoW64 客户机窗口内) 有何关系。 取消 : 仅捐献者 RAM，当池没有时内存会保持普通的RAM ;它从不进入交换文件，它将一个32位标题的堆积在闪存中并一次冻结几秒钟。 1: 捐献者 RAM，然后是交换文件，如 64 位程序( 旧行为 )。 2: 永远不要分级。 64位的启动器和旁边的帮助器仍然使用池和文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2190: on (default): every 2 s the app checks each connected controller's extended-gamepad profile and, when GameController has replaced it (a remap or a mode change after the controller joined), reads the live one; the first 8 times the sticks leave rest the raw values are logged ([xinput] ml2190). 0: a slot keeps the profile its controller had when it joined, as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2190:在(默认):每2 s 应用程序检查每个连接控制器的扩展游戏板配置，当Game Captain已经替换后(在控制器加入后重新映射或模式改变)，读取活版的;前8次棒离开时，原始值被记录([xput]ml2190). 0:一个插槽保留其控制器加入时的配置，和以前一样."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2200: on (the default), donor-pool-mb set and swap-mb unset start the swap tier with the donor pool as its only stage: no swap file is made, and memory the pool cannot cover stays normal app memory (iOS compresses it inside the app's limit). 0: without swap-mb the donor pool is not started, as before. Read at launch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2200:在(默认)上，捐赠者-集合-mb集和互换-mb未设置启动以共享内存池作为唯一阶段的互换级:不做互换文件，并且存储池无法覆盖保持正常的应用内存(iOS压缩它到应用限制内). 0:没有互换-mb，共享内存池无法像以前那样启动，在启动时读取."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2200: the tier maps the donor pool only, no file": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2200: 仅将共享内存池的级别映射到，没有文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2210: 1 (the Steam Big Picture list) lets steamwebhelper.exe start exactly one kind of child, --type=crashpad-handler, with its command line unchanged; without it the 32-bit web helper ends itself at start (crash server failed to launch). Every other --type= child stays refused. Off (default): all are refused.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2210: 1 (Steam Big Pictures列表) 允许 sourweb helper.exe 启动一个完全相同的孩子, --type=crashpad-handler，其命令行不变;没有它,32位的网络帮助器会自始至终结束(crash server 失败启动)。 所有其他 --type=childstay 拒绝。 关闭( 默认 ): 全部被拒绝。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2210: on (default): a 32-bit program's GROUP_AFFINITY thread attribute (12 bytes, a 32-bit mask) is decoded field by field when the thread is created; read as the 16-byte native struct, NtCreateThreadEx failed with c000000d and a 32-bit Chromium's thread pool threw. 0: read as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2210:在(默认):一个32位程序GROUT_AFFINITY线程属性(12字节,32位的面具)在线程创建时按字段解码;读作16字节的原生结构,NtCreateThreadEx以c000d失败,32位的Chromium线程池抛掷. 0:读如前."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2210: on (default): once Big Picture's folder holds the 32-bit client's web helper (bin/cef/cef.win7), steam.exe starts with -nobootstrapperupdate -skipinitialbootstrap, so it cannot move itself to the 64-bit client, whose CEF pools do not fit the address space. 0: Steam updates itself at every start, as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2210:在(默认):一旦Big Picture的文件夹持有32位客户端的网络帮助器(bin/cef/cef.win7),sour.exe开始于-nobootstrapupdate-skip rootstrap，因此无法移动到64位客户端，其CEF池不符合地址空间. 0:Steam每次启动时都会更新自己，和以前一样."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2220: on (default): when two adjacent guest windows' reserved areas have merged into one (a slot carved from the holdback beside slot 0), a 32-bit process's allocation is judged by the window that holds its request. Before, the first window in the merged area decided, the second process was refused its own window and failed to create its TEB (every second concurrent 32-bit process of a session). 0: as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2220: (默认):当两个相邻的客户机窗口的保留区域合并为一个(从保留槽旁边的0)时，一个32位进程的分配由持有请求的窗口来判断。在合并区域的第一个窗口决定之前，第二个进程被拒绝了自己的窗口，没有创建它的 TEB(一个会话的每个第二个同时的32位进程)。 0: 和以前一样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2230: 1 starts steam.exe without -cef-disable-gpu, so the web helper may draw with Chromium's ANGLE on the 32-bit D3D11 (DXMT) instead of the CPU. Off by default (software drawing, as before); a test switch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实验选项。默认关闭，使用软件渲染。设为 1 时，启动 steam.exe 时省略 -cef-disable-gpu，使网页辅助进程可使用 Chromium ANGLE 和 32 位 D3D11（DXMT）渲染。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2230: on (default): a server reply whose buffer lies in the JIT pool's address range but on a page that is writable at its own address (a page the pool gave up, which the system reused for a thread stack) is stored there, not through the pool's RW alias, which has no mapping for it. Before, a child process could die in its first reply (log 111: rpcss.exe, and the Steam client waited for it forever). 0: the pool's address range alone decides, as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2230:在(默认):一个服务器回复，其缓冲器位于JIT池的地址范围，但可写在自己的地址上(池放弃的一页，系统重新用于线程堆栈)，而不是通过池的RW化名存储在那里，该化名没有对此进行映射. 在此之前，一个儿童进程可能会在第一次回复中死亡(log 111: rpcs.exe，和Steam客户端永远等待它). 0:池的地址范围单独决定，和以前一样."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2230: on (default): before each Big Picture start, Big Picture's libraryfolders.vdf (config/ and steamapps/) gets Madeira's Steam library (the Dock client's folder) and the libraries on connected drives, beside the client's own entries, so the games Madeira installed show as installed. 0: the files are left alone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认开启。每次启动 Steam 大屏幕模式前，会把 Madeira 的 Steam 库和已连接驱动器的库并入 config/ 和 steamapps/ 中的 libraryfolders.vdf，让大屏幕模式识别已安装游戏。设置为 0 时保留原文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2230: on (default): steamwebhelper.exe gets --enable-logging=file --v=1 --log-severity=verbose, CEF's verbose file log. 0 (the Steam Big Picture list): Steam's own log level, which saves the UI threads the writes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2230: on (default): sourweb helper.exe gets --enable-log=file --v=1 --log-severity=动词,CEF的动词文件日志. 0(Steam Big Pictures列表):Steam自己的日志级别，它保存了UI线程的写法."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2240: a window above 4GB (between it and the task's floor) is marked with bit 63, which no PE base carries, so FEX files it as a window, not as a JIT alias (IosJitAlias.cpp).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2240:一个高于4GB(介于它和任务地板之间)的窗口被标为位63，没有PE基载，因此FEX将其作为窗口而不是JIT的别名(IosJitAlias.cpp)存档."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2240: on (default): Big Picture's libraryfolders.vdf gets every library Madeira's Steam list reads: the Dock client's folder, the other C: libraries its libraryfolders.vdf names and the external drives' libraries. The log names each library with its number of install records. 0: only the Dock client's folder and the external drives (ml2230).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2240: on(default):Big Picture的图书文件夹.vdf获得每个图书库 Madeira的Steam列表: Dock客户端的文件夹，其他C:库其图书文件夹.vdf名称和外部驱动器的库.每个库的日志名称及其安装记录数量. 0:只有Dock客户端的文件夹和外部驱动器(ml2230)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2240: on (default): a 64-bit exe or DLL without relocations whose base lies between 4 GB and the start of the app's address space (an old x64 linker's default 0x100000000, which iOS never maps) is mapped elsewhere, its header names the real base, and its own preferred-base addresses are served by the fault handler and FEX, as below 4 GB. The range is used only when a fixed allocation at its first and last page is refused as outside the map. Before, such an image failed to start (c0000018; log 115: the DirectX redistributable's x64 installer helper, so a game's first-run install script stopped). 0: the 4 GB limit, as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2240:在(默认):一个64位的Exe或DLL而不迁移，其基数位于4GB和应用程序地址空间启动之间(一个旧的x64链接器默认的0x100000000,iOS从未地图)在其他地方被映射，其标题命名真实的基数，以及自己的首选基数地址由断层处理器和FEX服务，低于4GB.该范围仅在其第一页和最后一页的固定分配被拒绝时作为地图外使用. 在此之前，这样的图像未能启动(c00018;log 115: DirectX可再分配的x64安装器帮助器，因此游戏的首发安装脚本停止). 0: 4GB限制，如以前一样."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2250: a 32-bit thread that has waited this many seconds without a timeout for an SRW lock held by shared owners has every 32-bit thread of its process logged once ([srw-hang]: x86 registers, EBP chain, module-resolved stack words), so the holders are named. Logs 116-119: Steam's 32-bit web helper stopped at start that way. 0: off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2250:一个32位线程，在等待了这么多秒之后，没有时间间隔等待共享所有者持有的SRW锁，其进程每32位线程记录一次([srw-hang]):x86注册,EBP链，模块解叠字)，所以持有者被命名. Logs 116-119:Steam的32位网络帮助器从那个开始就停止了. 0:关闭."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2250: unset (default): never. N: once a 32-bit thread has waited N seconds for an SRW lock as above, the wineserver ends its process, as TerminateProcess from another process would, so a parent that restarts its helper gets a new one (Steam restarts its web helper). At most 3 per app run. The Steam Big Picture list sets 40.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2250:未设置( 默认 ): 永远。 N:一旦一个32位线程像上面一样等待了 N 秒的 SRW 锁, Wine服务器就会结束其进程，因为终止程序会结束，所以重新启动其帮助器的父程序会获得一个新的程序( Steam 重新启动其网络帮助器)。 最多每个应用程序运行 3 个。 Steam Big Pictureset list set 40."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2260: on (default): when FEX starts in a 64-bit process it records the code sections of every image already loaded (kernel32, kernelbase, ucrtbase are mapped for it before its notifications work). Before, their x64 export thunks were not known as code: a 64-bit x64 program's call into one ended it with c0000005 (log 120: the DirectX redistributable's x64 helper, at its first kernel32 call). 0: as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2260:在(默认):当FEX在64位进程开始时，它记录了每个已装入的图像的代码段( 内核32，内核基, ucrtbase在通知工作前都会为它映射)。 在此之前，他们的x64导出thunks 并不被称为代码 :一个64位 x64 程序调用到一个程序以 c00000005 结束( 120 log: DirectX redustruble's x64 helfer，在其第一个内核32 调用)。 0 : 和以前一样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2270: on (default): when a 64-bit program opens the service manager and services.exe is not running (the session did not start Windows services first), sechost starts it once per process, waits up to 20 s for its pipe and asks again. Before, the call failed: a game from another store whose first start runs a launcher installer could not register the launcher's service and the installer stopped (testers' logs, 2026-10-28: a publisher's launcher installer run by an Epic copy's first start). 0: as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2270:在(默认):当一个64位程序打开服务管理器和服务.exe没有运行(会话没有首先启动Windows服务)时,sechost每次启动一次，最多等待20s的管道再询问. 在此之前，呼叫失败:来自另一个商店的游戏，其第一个启动运行的发射装置安装器无法注册发射装置的服务，安装器停止(测试器日志,2026-10-28:由Epic copy's firststart 运行的发布器安装器). 0:和以前一样."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2280: off (default): an aarch64 program (services.exe, cmd.exe, conhost.exe) started in a session whose first program is 64-bit x86 (ARM64EC) is refused and CreateProcess fails at once. The session's ntdll loads the emulator into it and its threads have no CPU area, so it crashed at its first executable allocation and its exception path faulted until the storm handler ended it (testers' log, 2026-10-28: services.exe started on demand for a launcher installer, twice, 20 s each). A game that needs one starts in the Wine desktop. 1: starts them anyway; MADEIRA_EC_CONHOST=1 still lets conhost.exe through.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2280: 关闭( 默认):一个arch64 程序( service.exe, cmd.exe, conhost.exe) 开始于一个会话，第一个程序是 64- bit x86( ARM64EC) 被拒绝，并且一次失败 CreatProcess。会话的ntdll加载模拟器进入它，其线程没有 CPU 区域，因此它在其第一个可执行分配时坠毁，并且它的例外路径被误差，直到风暴处理器结束为止( 测试器日志, 2026- 10- 28: 服务. exe 开始要求一个发射器安装器，每台20 s)。一个需要从 Wine 桌面开始的游戏 1:无论如何启动它们; MADEIRA_ EC_ CONHOST=1 仍然让 conhost. exe通过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2290: on (default): a thread that exits frees the previous exited thread's stacks only after finding that thread, by its process, thread id and pthread, in the live TEB list (the hand-off env.MADEIRA_EA_CEF = 1 already used). 32-bit processes started one after another can get the same window and TEB addresses; the unchecked hand-off then made a new thread free its own kernel stack at exit and hang there holding the memory lock (testers' log, 2026-10-31: a launcher installer's second VC++ redistributable, the installer waiting on that thread forever). 0: the upstream hand-off, unless MADEIRA_EA_CEF = 1.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2290:在(默认)上:一个线程在找到该线程后，才会释放出前一线程的堆栈，通过它的程序，线程id和pthread，在活的TEB列表中(掌上env.MADEIRA_EA_CEF=1已经使用). 32位进程一个接一个地启动，可以得到相同的窗口和TEB地址;不加控制的手动之后，在出口时就做了一条新的线程，释放了自己的内核堆栈，并在那里挂住内存锁(测试器日志,2026-10-31:一个发射装置安装器的第二个VC++可再分配，安装器在那个线程上永远等待). 0:上游手动，除非MADEIRA_EA_CEF=1."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2310: off (default): a game from another store (an Epic library entry) starts without the fixed Steam identity (SteamAppId, SteamGameId, SteamAppPath) every other launch outside Madeira Dock gets. With it, a game's launcher took its Steam path, its Steam API start failed and it showed only an error (testers' log, 2026-10-31: a publisher's launcher started by an Epic copy, 'Steam failed to initialize'). 1: publishes it as before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2310:关闭(默认):来自另一家商店(一个Epic库条目)的游戏开始时没有固定的Steam身份(SteamAppId,SteamGameId,SteamAppPath)，在Madeira码头之外的其他每一次发布都会得到.随着它，一个游戏的发布器都拿走了它的Steam路径，它的Steam API启动失败，它只显示一个错误(测试器日志,2026-10-31:一个由Epic副本启动的出版者发布器,\"Steam未能初始化\"). 1: 发布它和以前一样."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ml2320: on (default): an Epic library game's x64 program starts as the child of C:\\windows\\system32\\EpicGamesLauncher.exe (build/epic-parent: starts its command line, waits, returns its exit code; not the Epic client, no window, no network), as it does under the Epic client on Windows. A publisher's launcher that did not find a process with that name treated the Epic copy as not owned and showed its store page (testers' log, 2026-10-31: a publisher's launcher started by an Epic copy said 'Failed to relaunch from third party platform' and offered the game for sale; Heroic does the same for that launcher). A batch or a 32-bit program starts as before. 0: the program starts directly.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ml2320:在(默认):一个Epic 库游戏的x64程序从C:\\windows\\system32\\EpicGamesLauncher.exe(建设/epic-parent:开始命令行，等待，返回其退出代码;而不是Epic客户端，没有窗口，没有网络)开始，如同它在Windows上的Epic客户端下所做的那样。一个出版商的发布器没有找到一个进程，将Epic 副本视为没有拥有，并显示其商店页面(测试器日志,2026-10-31:一个由Epic 复制机启动的出版商的发布器说‘从第三方平台重新启动'，并提议游戏出售;Heroic对该发布器做同样的处理)。一个批或一个32位程序从前开始:程序直接启动。 0。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
