    },
    "The game asked to start %@. Madeira runs one game per app session: close Madeira and open it again, and %@ starts by itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏请求启动 %1$@。每次打开 Madeira 只能运行一个游戏。重新打开后将自动启动 %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Library could not be opened. The original file was preserved. ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法打开游戏库，原始文件已保留。 "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam signed in online on this device on %@ and can now sign this account in without a connection. With no internet, Madeira asks Steam to start the game offline; Steam checks its saved sign-in and its saved list of your licenses each time. Its offline sign-in expires after a while, so start a game online now and then. A game that needs its own servers still needs them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 已于 %1$@ 在此设备登录，可以用这个账户离线登录。离线启动时，Steam 会检查保存的登录信息和游戏许可。离线登录会过期，请偶尔联网启动游戏。需要连接游戏服务器的功能仍需联网。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam can sign this account in offline, but it prepares this game's program for your account the first time it starts, and that needs a connection. Start this game once while you are online.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此账户可以离线登录 Steam。Steam 首次启动此游戏时需要联网准备该账户的游戏程序，请先联网启动一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam has not saved an offline sign-in on this device yet. Start any Steam game once while you are online; after that, installed games can start without a connection.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设备还没有保存 Steam 的离线登录信息。请先联网启动一款 Steam 游戏，之后即可离线启动已安装的游戏。"
          }
