    "Madeira: id Tech 2/3 era games print or copy GL_EXTENSIONS into a fixed stack buffer (Jedi Academy: Com_Printf's 4 KB), and Zink's list is ~9 KB, so the copy overwrote the return address. Mesa lists extensions oldest first for exactly th...": {
